es of backward leaps\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What is the name of the tool used in the text to show the numbers 1 to 10?\",\"options\":[\"Number line\",\"Number strip\",\"Number box\",\"Number scale\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text repeatedly refers to the tool as a \'number strip\'.\",\"topic\":\"Examples of backward leaps\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What tool is used in the text to show the rabbit\'s leaps?\",\"options\":[\"A number strip\",\"A ruler\",\"A clock\",\"A ladder\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly mentions looking at the \'number strip\' to see the rabbit\'s leaps.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"The rabbit reached 1 by leaping backward from which number?\",\"options\":[\"5\",\"6\",\"10\",\"2\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states the rabbit reached at 1 by leaping backward from 10.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"When the rabbit leaps backward on the number strip, what action is it performing?\",\"options\":[\"Addition\",\"Subtraction\",\"Multiplication\",\"Division\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The topic of the text is \'Subtraction (By Counting backward)\'.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"According to the text, the rabbit reached 4 by leaping how many numbers backward from 6?\",\"options\":[\"1 number\",\"2 numbers\",\"3 numbers\",\"4 numbers\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text says the rabbit reached 4 by leaping 2 numbers backward from 6.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the rabbit\'s leap from 6 to 4, what is the answer to 6 - 2?\",\"options\":[\"8\",\"2\",\"4\",\"6\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text shows that leaping 2 numbers backward from 6 results in 4, so 6 - 2 = 4.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"If the rabbit is at 5 and leaps 1 number backward, what number will it reach?\",\