.\",\"We read 61 as Sixty-one.\",\"We read 70 as Seventy.\"]','[{\"q\":\"What is the number name for 21?\",\"options\":[\"Twenty one\",\"Twelve\",\"Two one\",\"Twenty\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"According to the text, 21 is written as Twenty one.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How many tens are there in the number Thirty?\",\"options\":[\"One Ten\",\"Two Tens\",\"Three Tens\",\"Zero Tens\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states that Thirty is Three Tens Zero units.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What is the number name for 27?\",\"options\":[\"Twenty six\",\"Twenty seven\",\"Twenty eight\",\"Seventy two\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text identifies 27 as Twenty seven.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Two Tens and Three units make which number?\",\"options\":[\"21\",\"22\",\"23\",\"32\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text shows that Two Tens Three units is 23.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which number has Two Tens and Five units?\",\"options\":[\"24\",\"25\",\"26\",\"52\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Two Tens Five units is Twenty five, which is 25.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"How many units are in the number Twenty six?\",\"options\":[\"Two units\",\"Six units\",\"Zero units\",\"Three units\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Twenty six consists of Two Tens and Six units.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If you have Two Tens and Four units, the number is:\",\"options\":[\"Twenty four\",\"Forty two\",\"Twenty\",\"Four\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"Two Tens Four units is written as Twenty four.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which number comes after Twenty eight in the sequence?\",\"options\":[\"Twenty seven\",\"Twenty nine\",\"Thirty\",\"Twenty six\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In the list provided, Twenty nine follows Twenty eight.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these numbers is different because it has Three Tens?\",\"options\":[\"28\",\"29\",\"30\",\"27\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"30 is Three Tens, while the others (27, 28, 29) all have Two Tens.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 22, how many tens and units are there?\",\"options\":[\"Two Tens Two units\",\"Two Tens One unit\",\"Three Tens Zero units\",\"Two Tens Three units\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text defines 22 as Two Tens Two units.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21216,3,1,'Maths','en','Introducing 31 to 99','[\"Numbers from 71 to 80 are made of 7 tens and some units.\",\"71 is 7 tens and 1 unit (Seventy-one).\",\"80 is 8 tens and 0 units (Eighty).\",\"Numbers from 81 to 90 are made of 8 tens and some units.\",\"81 is 8 tens and 1 unit (Eighty-one).\",\"90 is 9 tens and 0 units (Ninety).\",\"Numbers from 91 to 99 are made of 9 tens and some units.\",\"91 is 9 tens and 1 unit (Ninety-one).\",\"99 is 9 tens and 9 units (Ninety-nine).\",\"100 is 10 tens and 0 units (Hundred).\",\"The number after 79 is 80.\",\"The number after 89 is 90.\",\"The number after 99 is 100.\",\"To find the number after, add 1 to the current number.\",\"To find the middle number, look at the number before and the number after.\",\"Tens are groups of 10 items.\",\"Units are individual items less than 10.\",\"70 is seven tens.\",\"80 is eight tens.\",\"90 is nine tens.\",\"100 is ten tens.\",\"Always count tens first, then add the units.\",\"The sequence of numbers follows a constant order.\",\"98 comes before 99.\",\"85 comes between 84 and 86.\"]','[{\"q\":\"What is the number name for 45?\",\"options\":[\"Forty four\",\"Forty five\",\"Forty six\",\"Forty seven\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"According to the table, the number 45 is written as 