\":\"चित्रे मोज व संख्या लिही\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"चार बश्यांतील सीताफळांची बेरीज करताना \'२\' ही संख्या किती वेळा लिहावी लागते?\",\"options\":[\"२ वेळा\",\"३ वेळा\",\"४ वेळा\",\"५ वेळा\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"चार बश्यांसाठी २ ही संख्या ४ वेळा (२ + २ + २ + २) लिहावी लागते.\",\"topic\":\"चित्रे मोज व संख्या लिही\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"\'×\' या चिन्हास काय म्हणतात?\",\"options\":[\"बेरजेचे चिन्ह\",\"वजाबाकीचे चिन्ह\",\"गुणाकाराचे चिन्ह\",\"भागाकाराचे चिन्ह\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"पाठ्यपुस्तकानुसार \'×\' या चिन्हास गुणाकाराचे चिन्ह म्हणतात.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"२ × ३ = ६ याचे वाचन कसे करतात?\",\"options\":[\"दोन अधिक तीन बरोबर सहा\",\"दोन गुणिले तीन बरोबर सहा\",\"दोन वजा तीन बरोबर सहा\",\"दोन आणि तीन म्हणजे सहा\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"२ × ३ = ६ याचे वाचन \'दोन गुणिले तीन बरोबर सहा\' असे करतात.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"२ + २ + २ = ६ म्हणजे २ ही संख्या बेरजेत किती वेळा घेतली आहे?\",\"options\":[\"दोन वेळा\",\"चार वेळा\",\"तीन वेळा\",\"सहा वेळा\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"२ + २ + २ मध्ये २ ही संख्या तीन वेळा घेतली आहे.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"एकाच संख्येची पुन्हा पुन्हा केलेली बेरीज कोणत्या रूपात मांडता येते?\",\"options\":[\"वजाबाकीच्या\",\"गुणाकाराच्या\",\"फक्त बेरजेच्या\",\"गटाच्या\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"केलेली बेरीज गुणाकाराच्या रूपात मांडता येते, हे शिक्षकांनी स्पष्ट करावे.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"२ फुले तीन वेळा घेतली, तर एकूण किती फुले होतील?\",\"options\":[\"३ फुले\",\"५ फुले\",\"६ फुले\",\"२ फुले\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"२ फुले तीन वेळा म्हणजे २ + २ + २ = ६ फुले.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"\'दोन गुणिले तीन\' हे गुणाकाराच्या रूपात कसे लिहाल?\",\"options\":[\"२ + ३\",\"३ × २\",\"२ × ३\",\"२ - ३\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"दोन गुणिले तीन हे २ × ३ असे लिहिले जाते.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"गुणाकारासाठी कोणते चिन्ह वापरतात?\",\"options\":[\"+\",\"-\",\"=\",\"×\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"गुणाकारासाठी \'×\' हे चिन्ह वापरतात.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"२ × ३ = ६ या उदाहरणात \'६\' ही काय आहे?\",\"options\":[\"एकूण वस्तू\",\"वस्तूंचा गट\",\"गुणाकाराचे चिन्ह\",\"केलेली वजाबाकी\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"२ × ३ = ६ मध्ये ६ ही सर्व गटांतील एकूण वस्तूंची संख्या आहे.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"शिक्षकांनी विद्यार्थ्यांना ३-३ वस्तूंचे गट दाखवले, तर ते कोणती संकल्पना स्पष्ट करत आहेत?\",\"options\":[\"फक्त बेरीज\",\"गुणाकार पूर्वतयारी\",\"वजाबाकी\",\"संख्या वाचन\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"वस्तूंच्या गटांच्या आधारे गुणाकार स्पष्ट केला जातो.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"२ + २ + २ = ६ हे गुणाकार रूपात २ × ३ = ६ असे लिहितात. यात \'३\' काय दर्शवते?\",\"options\":[\"गटातील वस्तू\",\"एकूण बेरीज\",\"गट किती वेळा आला आहे\",\"गुणाकाराचे चिन्ह\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"गुणाकारात दुसरी संख्या (३) तो गट किती वेळा आला आहे हे दर्शवते.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"जर २ फुले ३ वेळा घेतली, तर खालीलपैकी कोणती बेरीज योग्य आहे?\",\"options\":[\"३ + ३\",\"२ + २ + २\",\"२ + ३\",\"२ + २\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"२ फुले ३ वेळा म्हणजे २ ची ३ वेळा बेरीज (२ + २ + २).\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"२ × ३ = ६ यातील \'गुणिले\' या शब्दासाठी कोणते चिन्ह वापरले आहे?\",\"options\":[\"=\",\"+\",\"×\",\"२\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"गुणाकारात \'गुणिले\' म्हणताना \'×\' हे चिन्ह वापरले जाते.\",\"topic\":\"शिक्षकांसाठी सूचना\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21253,4,1,'Maths','mr','समान वाटणी, समान गट','[\"समान वाटणी म्हणजे एखादी वस्तू सर्वांना सारखी वाटणे.\",\"समान गट म्हणजे वस्तूंचे गट समान आकाराचे बनवणे.\",\"उदाहरण: ६ पेन २‑२‑२ अशा गटात वाटणे.\",\"समान वाटणीसाठी वस्तूंची संख्या गटांच्या संख्येने भागली पाहिजे.\",\"जर ६ पेन २‑२‑२ वाटले तर प्रत्येकाला ३ पेन मिळतात.\",\"समान गटात गटांची संख्या = एकूण वस्तू ÷ गटातील वस्तू.\",\"उदाहरण: ६ पेरू २‑२‑२ गटात → ३ गट.\",\"उदाहरण: ६ पेरू ३‑३ गटात → २ गट.\",\"समान वाटणी करताना उरलेली वस्तू नसावी.\",\"समान गट करताना सर्व गट पूर्ण असावेत.\",\"वाटणी करताना ‘समान’ शब्दाचा अर्थ ‘समान’ असा आहे.\",\"वाटणीची गणना ‘भागाकार’ने होते.\",\"गट बनवताना ‘भागाकार’ने गटांची संख्या काढतात.\",\"समान वाटणी व गट हे दोन्ही ‘भागाकार’वर अवलंबून असतात.\",\"वाटणी व गट हे दैनंदिन जीवनात वापरले जाणारे सोपे गणिताचे उदाहरण आहेत.\",\"वाटणी व गट समजण्यासाठी वस्तूंची मोजणी महत्त्वाची आहे.\"]','[{\"q\":\"शिक्षिकेने सुरुवातीला सनी आणि मीनाला प्रत्येकी किती पेन्सिली दिल्या?\",\"options\":[\"२\",\"१\",\"३\",\"४\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"शिक्षिकेने सुरुवातीला सनीला १ आणि मीनाला १ पेन्सील दिली.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"शिक्षिकेने पेन्सिली किती जणांत वाटल्या?\",\"options\":[\"१\",\"३\",\"६\",\"२\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"पेन्सिली सनी आणि मीना अशा २ जणांत वाटल्या.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"शिक्षिकेने सनी आणि मीनाला एकूण किती पेन्सिली वाटल्या?\",\"options\":[\"२\",\"४\",\"६\",\"३\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"शिक्षिकेने एकूण ६ पेन्सिली वाटल्या.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"पहिल्यांदा प्रत्येकाला १-१ पेन्सील दिल्यावर शिक्षिकेकडे किती पेन्सिली उरल्या?\",\"options\":[\"६\",\"४\",\"२\",\"०\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"६ मधून २ गेल्यावर ४ पेन्सिली उरल्या.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"मीनाला एकूण किती पेन्सिली मिळाल्या?\",\"options\":[\"१\",\"२\",\"३\",\"६\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"वाटणी संपल्यावर मीनाला ३ पेन्सिली मिळाल्या.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"\'समान वाटणी\' म्हणजे काय?\",\"options\":[\"एकाला जास्त देणे\",\"एकाला कमी देणे\",\"दोघांना सारख्या देणे\",\"कोणालाच न देणे\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"समान वाटणी म्हणजे प्रत्येकाला सारखी संख्या मिळणे.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"शिक्षिकेने सनी आणि मीनाला किती वेळा पेन्सिली दिल्या?\",\"options\":[\"१ वेळा\",\"२ वेळा\",\"३ वेळा\",\"६ वेळा\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"शिक्षिकेने ३ वेळा १-१ पेन्सील दिली.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"६ पेन्सिली २ जणांत सारख्या वाटल्यास प्रत्येकाला किती मिळतात?\",\"options\":[\"२\",\"३\",\"४\",\"६\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"६ पेन्सिली २ जणांत वाटल्यास प्रत्येकाला ३ मिळतात.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"जेव्हा शिक्षिकेकडे शेवटच्या २ पेन्सिली उरल्या होत्या, तेव्हा त्यांनी प्रत्येकाला किती पेन्सील दिली?\",\"options\":[\"१\",\"२\",\"०\",\"३\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"उरलेल्या २ पेन्सिली पुन्हा १-१ करून वाटल्या.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"वाटणी पूर्ण झाल्यावर शिक्षिकेकडे किती पेन्सिली शिल्लक राहिल्या?\",\"options\":[\"६\",\"३\",\"२\",\"०\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"सर्व पेन्सिली वाटून झाल्यावर शिक्षिकेकडे काहीही (०) उरले नाही.\",\"topic\":\"समान वाटणी\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"पाठाच्या सुरुवातीला काय मोजायला सांगितले आहे?\",\"options\":[\"दगड\",\"पाने\",\"खडू\",\"फुले\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"पाठाच्या सुरुवातीला \'खडू मोज\' असे सांगितले आहे.\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"\\\"दोन-दोनचे गट करा\\\" असे कोणी म्हटले?\",\"options\":[\"चिंटू\",\"राणी\",\"शिक्षक\",\"आई\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"मजकुरानुसार चिंटू म्हणाला, \'पळतापळता दोन-दोनचे गट करा.\'\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"दिलेल्या आकृतीत एकूण किती मुले पळत आहेत?\",\"options\":[\"४\",\"५\",\"६\",\"७\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"आकृतीमध्ये वर्तुळाभोवती ६ मुले पळताना दिसत आहेत.\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"apply\",\"figure_image\":\"4\\/107_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"दिलेल्या आकृतीत दोन-दोन मुलांचे किती गट तयार झाले आहेत?\",\"options\":[\"२\",\"३\",\"४\",\"५\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"आकृतीत ६ मुलांचे दोन-दोन प्रमाणे ३ गट झाले आहेत.\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"analyze\",\"figure_image\":\"4\\/107_102.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"खेळात घेतलेले सर्व विद्यार्थी कसे विभागले जातील?\",\"options\":[\"गटांत विभागले जातील\",\"एकटे राहतील\",\"घरी जातील\",\"खेळणार नाहीत\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"मजकुरानुसार खेळात घेतलेले सर्व विद्यार्थी गटांत विभागले जातील.\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"प्रत्येक वेळी सर्व गट कसे असावेत?\",\"options\":[\"वेगवेगळे\",\"लहान-मोठे\",\"समान\",\"अपूर्ण\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"मजकुरात सांगितले आहे की प्रत्येक वेळी सर्व गट समान राहतील.\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"\\\"तीन-तीनचे गट करा\\\" असे कोणी म्हटले?\",\"options\":[\"चिंटू\",\"राणी\",\"बाबा\",\"ताई\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"मजकुरानुसार राणी म्हणाली, \'पळतापळता तीन-तीनचे गट करा.\'\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"दिलेल्या आकृतीत चिमण्यांचे दोन-दोनचे गट केल्यास एकूण किती गट तयार होतील?\",\"options\":[\"२\",\"४\",\"५\",\"१०\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"एकूण १० चिमण्या आहेत, त्यांचे दोन-दोनचे ५ गट तयार होतात.\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"create\",\"figure_image\":\"4\\/108_103.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"जर खेळात ८ विद्यार्थी असतील आणि ४-४ चे गट केले, तर किती गट तयार होतील?\",\"options\":[\"१\",\"२\",\"३\",\"४\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"८ विद्यार्थ्यांचे ४-४ चे २ समान गट तयार होतात.\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"खेळ खेळताना कोणताही गट कसा राहणार नाही याची काळजी घ्यावी?\",\"options\":[\"पूर्ण\",\"अपूर्ण\",\"मोठा\",\"छोटा\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"मजकुरानुसार कोणताही गट अपूर्ण राहणार नाही, एवढे विद्यार्थी घ्यावेत.\",\"topic\":\"खेळ खेळू\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"understand\"}]','vertex/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21254,4,1,'Maths','mr','गणितीय कोडी','[\"गणितीय कोडी म्हणजे लहान गणिती प्रश्न जे आपल्याला विचार करण्यास आणि सोडविण्यास मदत करतात.\",\"या कोड्यांमध्ये बेरीज, वजाबाकी, संख्या ओळखणे आणि नमुना शोधणे यांचा समावेश असतो.\",\"बेरीज म्हणजे दोन किंवा अधिक संख्यांचे एकत्रित योग.\",\"वजाबाकी म्हणजे एक संख्या दुसऱ्या संख्येतून वजा करणे.\",\"बेरीज आणि वजाबाकी करताना आपण डावीकडून उजवीकडे किंवा उजवीकडून डावीकडे जाऊ शकतो.\",\"संख्या ओळखताना आपण १ ते १०० पर्यंतच्या संख्यांचा वापर करतो.\",\"कोड्यांमध्ये दिलेल्या आकृत्यांवर संख्या लिहून नमुना पूर्ण करणे आवश्यक असते.\",\"प्रत्येक रांगेत आणि स्तंभात एकच संख्या एकदाच येऊ शकते.\",\"वर्तुळांवर संख्या लिहिताना दोन्ही बाजूंची बेरीज समान असावी.\",\"सोप्या गणिती प्रश्नांमध्ये आपण १ ते ५, १ ते १० अशा लहान संख्यांचा वापर करतो.\",\"प्रश्नांमध्ये रिकाम्या जागा भरण्यासाठी ______ वापरले जाते.\",\"सत्य\\/असत्य प्रश्नांमध्ये उत्तर \'सत्य\' किंवा \'असत्य\' असे द्यायचे असते.\",\"मॅचिंग प्रश्नांमध्ये दोन स्तंभांतील घटक जुळवायचे असतात.\",\"प्रश्नांची उत्तरे लहान व स्पष्ट असावीत.\",\"सोप्या शब्दांत प्रश्न व उत्तरे समजावून सांगणे महत्त्वाचे आहे.\",\"गणिताचे नियम आणि सूत्रे लक्षात ठेवणे आवश्यक आहे.\",\"प्रश्न सोडवताना पायरी पायरीने विचार करणे चांगले असते.\",\"काही प्रश्नांमध्ये आकृती किंवा चित्र आवश्यक असू शकते.\",\"अशा आकृत्यांवर संख्या लिहिणे किंवा रेषा काढणे हे काम असू शकते.\",\"प्रश्नांचे उत्तर दिल्यानंतर आपण त्यांची तपासणी करणे आवश्यक आहे.\",\"गणितीय कोडी सोडवताना आपण तर्कशक्ती आणि निरीक्षण कौशल्य वापरतो.\",\"प्रत्येक प्रश्नाचे उत्तर दिल्यानंतर आपण ते बरोबर आहे का ते पाहू.\",\"गणित शिकताना सराव करणे आणि प्रश्न सोडवणे हे महत्त्वाचे आहे.\",\"गणितीय कोडी आपल्याला मजेदार पद्धतीने शिकवतात.\"]','[{\"q\":\"जंगलात कोणाची सभा भरली होती?\",\"options\":[\"पक्ष्यांची\",\"प्राण्यांची\",\"फुलांची\",\"माणसांची\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"मजकुराच्या पहिल्या ओळीत दिले आहे की जंगलात प्राण्यांची सभा भरली होती.\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"सभेत आलेल्या सर्व प्राण्यांचे स्वागत कोणी केले?\",\"options\":[\"सिंहाने\",\"वाघाने\",\"जिराफाने\",\"हत्तीने\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"मजकुरात दिले आहे की जिराफाने सर्वांचे स्वागत केले.\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"सभेच्या शेवटी सर्वांचे आभार कोणी मानले?\",\"options\":[\"वाघाने\",\"कोल्ह्याने\",\"हरीणाने\",\"गेंड्याने\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"मजकुराच्या शेवटी दिले आहे की वाघाने सर्वांचे आभार मानले.\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"मजकुरात दिलेल्या माहितीनुसार, सभेतील प्राण्यांची एकूण संख्या किती आहे?\",\"options\":[\"७\",\"८\",\"९\",\"१०\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"८ प्राणी (हत्ती, वाघ, कोल्हा, काळवीट, गेंडा, झेब्रा, जिराफ, हरीण) आणि १ राजा सिंह मिळून एकूण ९ प्राणी आहेत.\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"राजाने प्राण्यांना कोणती ताकीद दिली?\",\"options\":[\"गप्प बसण्याची\",\"कामे वेळेत पूर्ण करण्याची\",\"पळून जाण्याची\",\"गाणी गाण्याची\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"राजाने सर्वांना कामे विभागून दिली व ती वेळेत पूर्ण करण्याची ताकीद दिली.\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"सभेत असणाऱ्या सर्व ९ प्राण्यांच्या डोळ्यांची एकूण संख्या किती होईल?\",\"options\":[\"९\",\"१२\",\"१५\",\"१८\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"एका प्राण्याला २ डोळे असतात, म्हणून ९ प्राण्यांचे एकूण १८ डोळे होतील (९ x २ = १८).\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"दिलेल्या चित्रात किती प्राण्यांना शिंगे दिसत आहेत?\",\"options\":[\"२\",\"३\",\"४\",\"५\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"चित्रात गेंडा, हरीण, काळवीट आणि जिराफ या ४ प्राण्यांना शिंगे आहेत.\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"analyze\",\"figure_image\":\"4\\/109_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"दिलेल्या चित्रात हत्तीच्या अगदी समोर कोणता प्राणी उभा आहे?\",\"options\":[\"वाघ\",\"झेब्रा\",\"कोल्हा\",\"सिंह\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"चित्रात हत्ती आणि झेब्रा एकमेकांसमोर उभे राहून संवाद साधत आहेत.\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\",\"figure_image\":\"4\\/109_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"राजाने प्राण्यांच्या कोणत्या गोष्टी सोडवल्या?\",\"options\":[\"अडचणी\",\"खेळ\",\"भांडणे\",\"कोडी\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"मजकुरात दिले आहे की राजाने सर्व अडचणी सोडवल्या.\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"मजकुरात दिलेल्या प्राण्यांच्या यादीत खालीलपैकी कोणता प्राणी नाही?\",\"options\":[\"काळवीट\",\"झेब्रा\",\"उंट\",\"कोल्हा\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"मजकुरात उंटाचा उल्लेख कोठेही आलेला नाही.\",\"topic\":\"जंगल सभा\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"पाठात दिलेल्या खेळाचे नाव काय आहे?\",\"options\":[\"बेरीज-वजाबाकी झुंज\",\"अंक लेखन\",\"संख्यांची बेरीज\",\"वजाबाकी करा\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"पाठात खेळाचे नाव \'बेरीज-वजाबाकी झुंज\' असे दिले आहे.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"चौकटीतील अपेक्षित उत्तर कोणाच्या हातातून शोधायचे आहे?\",\"options\":[\"मुलाच्या\",\"शिक्षकांच्या\",\"टेडीबेअरच्या\",\"आईच्या\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"मजकुरात \'अपेक्षित उत्तर टेडीबेअरच्या हातातून शोधावे\' असे स्पष्ट म्हटले आहे.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"उत्तर लिहून झाल्यानंतर संख्याकार्डवर काय करायचे आहे?\",\"options\":[\"संख्या पुसून टाकावी\",\"संख्याकार्डवर रेघ मारावी\",\"संख्या रंगवावी\",\"कार्ड फाडून टाकावे\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"मजकुरात \'उत्तर लिहून झाल्यानंतर टेडीबेअरच्या संख्याकार्डवर रेघ मारावी\' असे सांगितले आहे.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"बेरीज-वजाबाकी झुंज या खेळात विजयी कोण ठरेल?\",\"options\":[\"जो सर्वात आधी पळेल\",\"ज्याच्या सर्वात पंक्तींच्या उत्तराच्या संख्या शोधून व लिहून होतील\",\"जो सर्वात मोठी संख्या लिहील\",\"जो सर्वात जास्त वेळ खेळेल\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"ज्याच्या सर्व पंक्तींच्या उत्तराच्या संख्या शोधून पूर्ण होतील, तो विजयी ठरेल.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"मधली संख्या तयार करण्यासाठी कोणत्या क्रिया करायच्या आहेत?\",\"options\":[\"फक्त बेरीज\",\"फक्त वजाबाकी\",\"बेरीज किंवा वजाबाकी\",\"गुणाकार\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"मजकुरात \'बेरीज किंवा वजाबाकी करून मधली संख्या तयार कर\' असे दिले आहे.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"उभी व आडवी बेरीज ६ येण्यासाठी कोणत्या संख्या वापरायच्या आहेत?\",\"options\":[\"१ ते ५\",\"१ ते ३\",\"४ ते ६\",\"० ते ३\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"मजकुरात \'१ ते ३ संख्या अशा लिही\' असे स्पष्टपणे सांगितले आहे.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"प्रत्येक रांगेत एक संख्या किती वेळा आली पाहिजे?\",\"options\":[\"दोनदा\",\"एकदाच\",\"तीनदा\",\"कितीही वेळा\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"मजकुरात \'प्रत्येक रांगेत एक संख्या एकदाच आली पाहिजे\' अशी अट दिली आहे.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"जर १, २ आणि ३ या संख्या वापरल्या, तर त्यांची बेरीज किती येईल?\",\"options\":[\"४\",\"५\",\"६\",\"३\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"१ + २ + ३ = ६, जी कोडी सोडवण्यासाठी अपेक्षित बेरीज आहे.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"बेरीज किंवा वजाबाकी करून \'५\' ही मधली संख्या कशी तयार होईल?\",\"options\":[\"३ + २\",\"२ + २\",\"५ - २\",\"४ - १\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"३ + २ ची बेरीज ५ येते, जी मधली संख्या असू शकते.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"उभी व आडवी मांडणी करताना कोणती गोष्ट महत्त्वाची आहे?\",\"options\":[\"संख्यांची बेरीज समान येणे\",\"मोठ्या संख्या वापरणे\",\"फक्त आडवी बेरीज करणे\",\"संख्या क्रमाने लिहिणे\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"कोड्याच्या अटीनुसार उभी व आडवी बेरीज ६ (समान) येणे आवश्यक आहे.\",\"topic\":\"संख्यांची उभी व आडवी मांडणी\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"वर्तुळांच्या कोड्यात १ ते ५ पैकी प्रत्येक संख्या किती वेळा लिहायची आहे?\",\"options\":[\"दोनदा\",\"एकदाच\",\"तीनदा\",\"पाचदा\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"पाठ्यपुस्तकानुसार प्रत्येक संख्या एकदाच आली पाहिजे.\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"\'जवळचा मार्ग\' शोधणे म्हणजे काय?\",\"options\":[\"लांबचा रस्ता शोधणे\",\"कमी अंतराचा रस्ता शोधणे\",\"वळणदार रस्ता शोधणे\",\"रस्ता बंद करणे\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"जवळचा मार्ग म्हणजे जो रस्ता कमी अंतराचा असतो.\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"ठोकळ्यांची मांडणी \'वाढत जाणारी\' आहे. जर तिसऱ्या ओळीत ३ ठोकळे असतील, तर चौथ्या ओळीत किती ठोकळे येतील?\",\"options\":[\"२\",\"३\",\"४\",\"५\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"वाढत जाणाऱ्या मांडणीत पुढची संख्या मोठी असते (३ नंतर ४).\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"१ ते ५ संख्या वापरून दोन्ही बाजूंची बेरीज समान करायची आहे. जर मधल्या वर्तुळात ३ असेल, तर एका बाजूची बेरीज (१+३+५) किती होईल?\",\"options\":[\"७\",\"८\",\"९\",\"१०\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"१ + ३ + ५ = ९ ही बेरीज येते.\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"चित्र पूर्ण करण्यासाठी १ पासून कोणत्या संख्येपर्यंत अंक क्रमाने जोडायचे आहेत?\",\"options\":[\"५\",\"१०\",\"१५\",\"२०\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"पाठ्यपुस्तकात १ ते २० संख्या जोडण्यास सांगितले आहे.\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"\'वाढत जाणारी मांडणी\' पूर्ण करताना आपण काय करतो?\",\"options\":[\"ठोकळे कमी करतो\",\"ठोकळे वाढवतो\",\"ठोकळे काढतो\",\"काहीच करत नाही\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"वाढत जाणाऱ्या मांडणीत वस्तूंची संख्या क्रमाने वाढत जाते.\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"१ ते २० संख्या क्रमाने जोडताना, १० च्या लगेच आधी कोणती संख्या येते?\",\"options\":[\"९\",\"११\",\"८\",\"१२\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"क्रमाने येणाऱ्या संख्यांमध्ये १० च्या आधी ९ येतो.\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"जवळच्या मार्गाखाली कोणते चिन्ह करण्यास सांगितले आहे?\",\"options\":[\"✗\",\"✓\",\"○\",\"+\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"पाठ्यपुस्तकात जवळच्या मार्गाखाली ✓ (टिक) हे चिन्ह करण्यास सांगितले आहे.\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"१ ते ५ संख्यांच्या कोड्यात, जर एका बाजूला ५, ३, १ या संख्या असतील, तर दुसऱ्या बाजूला ३ सोबत कोणत्या दोन संख्या येतील जेणेकरून बेरीज समान होईल?\",\"options\":[\"१ आणि २\",\"२ आणि ४\",\"४ आणि ५\",\"१ आणि ५\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"३ + २ + ४ = ९, जी पहिल्या बाजूच्या बेरजेइतकी (९) आहे.\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"\'दोन्ही बाजूंची बेरीज समान येणे\' म्हणजे काय?\",\"options\":[\"बेरीज वेगळी असणे\",\"बेरीज सारखी असणे\",\"बेरीज शून्य असणे\",\"बेरीज मोठी असणे\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"समान म्हणजे सारखे, म्हणून बेरीज सारखी असणे असा त्याचा अर्थ होतो.\",\"topic\":\"स्वाध्याय\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"understand\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21255,5,2,'English','en','Welcome to School','[\"- Welcome to School is the first unit of the English textbook for Standard 2.\",\"- The unit teaches children how to greet teachers and friends politely.\",\"- Students learn simple greetings like ‘Good morning’ and ‘Hello’.\",\"- They practice singing a welcome song about school life.\",\"- The unit includes listening activities where children answer questions about their feelings toward school.\",\"- Children are encouraged to use new words such as school, teacher, class, gate, swing, slide, blackboard, and school bag.\",\"- The book suggests making a ‘Word‑Bank’ to collect and review new words.\",\"- A Word‑Bank is a small box or container where students write new words on paper chits and keep them for later study.\",\"- The teacher can use flash cards with the new words to help students make sentences.\",\"- Students are asked to describe their school as green and clean, showing they can use adjectives.\",\"- The unit also has a picture of a school playground to help students talk about what they see.\",\"- Students learn to say ‘Good morning’ to teachers and ‘Hello’ to friends.\",\"- The unit encourages children to be good and learn in a fun way.\",\"- The activities help children practice speaking, listening, and writing in a simple way.\",\"- The unit ends with a small activity called ‘Open the Treasure’ to review the words learned.\",\"- The overall goal is to make children feel happy and excited about going to school.\",\"- The unit uses short, simple sentences suitable for Standard 2 learners.\",\"- It focuses on everyday school life and basic social interactions.\",\"- The teacher’s notes give practical tips for classroom activities.\",\"- The unit is part of the Maharashtra State Board Balbharati curriculum for Standard 2 English.\"]','[{\"q\":\"Where are the boys and girls being welcomed in the poem?\",\"options\":[\"To the park\",\"To the school\",\"To the market\",\"To the playground\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The poem repeatedly says \'Welcome to school\'.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What should you say when you meet your friends at school?\",\"options\":[\"Goodbye\",\"Thank you\",\"Hello\",\"Sorry\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The poem says, \'With your friends, And say, Hello\'.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"According to the poem, what should you say when you meet your teachers?\",\"options\":[\"Good morning\",\"Good night\",\"Happy birthday\",\"Welcome\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The poem says, \'Meet your teachers, Say Good morning\'.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What are the two main activities mentioned in the poem that happen at school?\",\"options\":[\"Eating and sleeping\",\"Running and jumping\",\"Learn and play\",\"Fighting and crying\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The poem states, \'Learn and play, Be good in every way\'.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If you follow the poem\'s advice to \'be good in every way\', how should you behave at school?\",\"options\":[\"By only playing all day\",\"By being polite and learning well\",\"By not talking to friends\",\"By not greeting teachers\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Being \'good in every way\' implies positive behavior like learning and greeting others.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the poem, who is being welcomed to the school?\",\"options\":[\"Only the boys\",\"Only the girls\",\"Both boys and girls\",\"Only the teachers\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The poem explicitly addresses \'Boys and girls\'.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Why does the poem suggest saying \'Hello\' and \'Good morning\'?\",\"options\":[\"To be loud\",\"To be polite and greet others\",\"To finish the song\",\"To go back home\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"These are standard greetings used to be polite when meeting people.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"What is the overall mood or feeling of this poem?\",\"options\":[\"Sad and lonely\",\"Angry and loud\",\"Welcoming and happy\",\"Scary and dark\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The poem uses the word \'Welcome\' many times and encourages playing and learning.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"create\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what is the name of the school written on the entrance gate?\",\"options\":[\"City Primary School\",\"Z. P. Primary School\",\"Model Primary School\",\"State Primary School\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text on the archway in the picture clearly says \'Z. P. Primary School\'.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\",\"figure_image\":\"5\\/011_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what are the teachers holding to welcome the students?\",\"options\":[\"Bags and water bottles\",\"Sticks and stones\",\"Books and flowers\",\"Toys and balls\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The illustration shows the male teacher holding books and the female teacher holding flowers.\",\"topic\":\"Listen, sing and recite\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\",\"figure_image\":\"5\\/011_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"According to the text, how is the school described?\",\"options\":[\"Big and tall\",\"Green and clean\",\"Old and small\",\"Blue and new\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly states, \'My school is green and clean.\'\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these words from the list is used for playing in the school?\",\"options\":[\"Dustbin\",\"Blackboard\",\"Slide\",\"Gate\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"A slide is a piece of play equipment mentioned in the word list.\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What does the student say about their school in the text?\",\"options\":[\"I like my school.\",\"I want to play.\",\"I am tired.\",\"I like my home.\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text includes the sentence \'I like my school.\'\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which person from the word list helps students learn in a school?\",\"options\":[\"Doctor\",\"Teacher\",\"Driver\",\"Pilot\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"A teacher is the professional mentioned in the list who works in a school.\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which object from the list is used by students to carry their books?\",\"options\":[\"Dustbin\",\"School bag\",\"Swing\",\"Gate\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"A school bag is used to carry books and belongings to school.\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Where do students sit to study according to the words provided?\",\"options\":[\"Ground\",\"Class\",\"Swing\",\"Gate\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The word \'class\' refers to the classroom where students study.\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what is the name of the school written on the gate?\",\"options\":[\"City Public School\",\"Z. P. Primary School\",\"Model School\",\"Happy School\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text on the arch in the picture clearly says \'Z. P. Primary School\'.\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\",\"figure_image\":\"5\\/012_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what is the teacher doing at the gate?\",\"options\":[\"Teaching a lesson\",\"Welcoming the students\",\"Cleaning the ground\",\"Playing on the slide\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The teacher is shown greeting and welcoming children as they enter the school.\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\",\"figure_image\":\"5\\/012_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"To keep the school \'clean\' as mentioned in the text, which object from the list should be used for trash?\",\"options\":[\"Blackboard\",\"Dustbin\",\"Swing\",\"Gate\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"A dustbin is used to collect waste and keep the surroundings clean.\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which word from the list refers to the other children you play and study with?\",\"options\":[\"Trees\",\"Friends\",\"Dustbin\",\"Gate\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The word \'friend\' refers to the companions students have at school.\",\"topic\":\"Observe and talk\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What should you use to make a \'Word-Bank\'?\",\"options\":[\"A new school bag\",\"An empty box or container\",\"A heavy stone\",\"A glass of water\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states to take any empty box or container to make a Word-Bank.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What should you do with the scrap paper while making the \'Word-Bank\'?\",\"options\":[\"Throw it in the bin\",\"Make a paper plane\",\"Cover the box and decorate it\",\"Eat it\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The instructions say to cover the box with scrap paper and decorate it.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what name is written on both the container and the box?\",\"options\":[\"\'My Box\'\",\"\'School\'\",\"\'Word-Bank\'\",\"\'Teacher\'\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The image shows both items labeled as \'Word-Bank\'.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\",\"figure_image\":\"5\\/013_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"What is the first thing you should do when you learn a new word in a subunit?\",\"options\":[\"Underline the word\",\"Erase the word\",\"Color the whole page\",\"Close the book\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text instructs to underline the new words you learnt in each subunit.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Where should you copy the underlined words?\",\"options\":[\"On your hand\",\"On the wall\",\"In the chits\",\"On the floor\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The instructions say to copy the underlined words in the chits.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which specific word is written on the chit being put into the box?\",\"options\":[\"bank\",\"school\",\"word\",\"teacher\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The illustration shows a hand dropping a chit with the word \'school\' written on it.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\",\"figure_image\":\"5\\/013_102.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"What should you do just before dropping the chits into your \'Word-Bank\'?\",\"options\":[\"Read the word aloud\",\"Sleep for some time\",\"Draw a picture of a bird\",\"Tear the chit\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text says to read the word aloud before dropping the chits into the Word-Bank.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"If you have a decorated box and some chits with words, what have you created?\",\"options\":[\"A lunch box\",\"A \'Word-Bank\'\",\"A pencil case\",\"A toy car\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Following the steps of decorating a box and adding word chits creates a Word-Bank.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"create\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the instructions, which of these is needed to use the \'Word-Bank\'?\",\"options\":[\"A paintbrush\",\"A new word from a subunit\",\"A bottle of glue\",\"A pair of shoes\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"To use the bank, you need to underline and copy new words you have learnt.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What is the final step in using the \'Word-Bank\'?\",\"options\":[\"Throw the box away\",\"Underline the word\",\"Drop the chits into your \'Word-Bank\'\",\"Decorate the scrap paper\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The last step mentioned in \'How to use it\' is to drop the chits into the Word-Bank.\",\"topic\":\"Make your own \'Word-Bank\'\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What should every child make according to the instructions?\",\"options\":[\"A story book\",\"A Word-Bank\",\"A drawing\",\"A toy\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states that the teacher should ensure each child makes his\\/her own \'Word-Bank\'.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What should children make for each subunit?\",\"options\":[\"Chits of words\",\"Pictures\",\"Sentences\",\"Numbers\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text encourages children to make chits of words for each subunit.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Where can the teacher find the activities to conduct at the end of a Unit?\",\"options\":[\"In the library\",\"In \'Open the Treasure\'\",\"In the newspaper\",\"In a notebook\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text mentions conducting activities as shown in \'Open the Treasure\'.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Who are these specific instructions written for?\",\"options\":[\"The parents\",\"The principal\",\"The teacher\",\"The shopkeeper\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The heading of the topic is \'For the Teacher\'.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"When should children bring their Word-Banks to class?\",\"options\":[\"Every morning\",\"At the end of every Unit\",\"Only on Mondays\",\"Once a year\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text says to ask children to bring their \'Word-Banks\' at the end of every Unit.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What is the teacher\'s role regarding the Word-Bank?\",\"options\":[\"To make it for the child\",\"To ensure each child makes their own\",\"To throw it away\",\"To hide it from the class\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The teacher must ensure that each child makes his\\/her own \'Word-Bank\'.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If a class has just finished Unit 1, what should the teacher ask the children to bring to class?\",\"options\":[\"Their lunch\",\"Their Word-Banks\",\"Their toys\",\"Their pillows\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"According to the text, Word-Banks are brought to class at the end of every Unit.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"A teacher wants to start an activity at the end of a Unit. Where should they look in the book?\",\"options\":[\"At the start of the book\",\"In the \'Open the Treasure\' section\",\"In the index\",\"On the cover page\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text directs the teacher to conduct activities shown in \'Open the Treasure\'.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the text, what is the link between \'Word-Banks\' and \'Units\'?\",\"options\":[\"Word-Banks are brought to class at the end of Units\",\"Units are stored inside Word-Banks\",\"Word-Banks are only for the first Unit\",\"Units are made of paper chits\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The instructions link the timing of bringing the Word-Bank to the end of a Unit.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which task is the teacher responsible for ensuring happens for every child?\",\"options\":[\"Each child makes their own Word-Bank\",\"Each child buys a new book\",\"Each child goes home early\",\"Each child draws a map\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The first instruction for the teacher is to ensure each child makes their own Word-Bank.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21256,5,2,'English','en','Back to School','[\"Back to school means the school starts after summer vacation.\",\"Students go back to their classroom and teachers after a break.\",\"We greet each other with friendly words like ‘Hello’ and ‘Hi’.\",\"We ask how the other person is feeling: ‘How are you?’\",\"We say ‘I am good’ or ‘I am fine’ when asked how we feel.\",\"We talk about the summer vacation: what we did and where we went.\",\"We can say ‘I enjoyed a lot’ to show we had fun.\",\"We can share places we visited: e.g., ‘I went to my uncle’s village in Konkan’ or ‘I visited Tadoba’.\",\"We can mention animals we saw: ‘I saw tigers there’.\",\"We can express happiness: ‘I am so happy to see you again’.\",\"We can say ‘Let’s go to our classroom’ to start the school day.\",\"Teachers encourage children to speak and practice conversation.\",\"Teachers give children more chances to talk with classmates.\",\"Teachers help children learn new words and use them in sentences.\",\"Students should listen carefully and repeat after the teacher.\",\"Students should use polite words like ‘please’ and ‘thank you’ when speaking.\",\"Students should greet their classmates and teachers every day.\",\"Students should be ready to learn new lessons after the break.\",\"Students should bring their books, notebooks, and pencils to school.\",\"Students should keep their classroom clean and tidy.\",\"Students should respect their teachers and classmates.\",\"Students should follow school rules and listen to instructions.\",\"Students should ask questions if they do not understand something.\",\"Students should share their experiences from the vacation with friends.\"]','[{\"q\":\"Who are the two friends talking in the story?\",\"options\":[\"Rohit and Sonal\",\"Rahul and Sonal\",\"Rohit and Snehal\",\"Raj and Sonal\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text begins with a conversation between Rohit and Sonal.\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Where did Rohit go during his summer vacation?\",\"options\":[\"To a big city\",\"To his uncle\'s village\",\"To a zoo\",\"To a new school\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Rohit says, \'I went to my uncle’s village in Konkan.\'\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In which region is Rohit\'s uncle\'s village located?\",\"options\":[\"Vidarbha\",\"Khandesh\",\"Konkan\",\"Marathwada\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Rohit mentions that the village is in Konkan.\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How does Sonal feel about seeing Rohit again?\",\"options\":[\"She is sad\",\"She is scared\",\"She is happy\",\"She is angry\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Sonal says, \'I am so happy to see you again.\'\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which place did Sonal visit during her vacation?\",\"options\":[\"Konkan\",\"Tadoba\",\"A village\",\"A classroom\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Sonal says, \'I visited Tadoba.\'\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What animal did Sonal see at Tadoba?\",\"options\":[\"Lions\",\"Elephants\",\"Tigers\",\"Bears\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Sonal says, \'I saw tigers there.\'\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If you meet a friend on the first day after holidays, what is a polite way to greet them according to the text?\",\"options\":[\"Go to the classroom.\",\"Welcome back to school.\",\"I saw tigers.\",\"I went to a village.\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Rohit greets Sonal by saying \'Welcome back to school.\'\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"When Sonal says \'I enjoyed a lot\', what is she talking about?\",\"options\":[\"Her homework\",\"Her summer vacation\",\"Her classroom\",\"Her lunch\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"She says this in response to Rohit\'s question about enjoying summer vacation.\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Where are Rohit and Sonal going at the end of their conversation?\",\"options\":[\"To the village\",\"To Tadoba\",\"To their classroom\",\"To the playground\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Sonal says, \'Let’s go to our classroom.\'\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the dialogue, which of these is true about Rohit and Sonal?\",\"options\":[\"They both went to the same village.\",\"They both saw tigers.\",\"They both enjoyed their summer vacation.\",\"They both live in Konkan.\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Both Rohit and Sonal express that they had a good time during their vacations.\",\"topic\":\"Vacation Stories\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"What should the teacher give children more exposure to?\",\"options\":[\"Writing\",\"Communicating\",\"Sleeping\",\"Drawing\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly states to \'Give more exposure to the children to communicate.\'\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In what should the teacher engage the children?\",\"options\":[\"Similar conversations\",\"Silent reading\",\"Math problems\",\"Running races\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text says to \'Engage the children in similar conversations.\'\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Besides speaking, what else should the teacher promote the children to do?\",\"options\":[\"Enact\",\"Hide\",\"Cry\",\"Paint\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text mentions to \'Promote the children to speak and enact.\'\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What is the main goal of giving children \'more exposure\' according to the text?\",\"options\":[\"To make them finish homework\",\"To help them communicate\",\"To keep the classroom quiet\",\"To teach them how to sit\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Exposure is specifically linked to communication in the text.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What does the word \'promote\' mean in the context of speaking and enacting?\",\"options\":[\"To stop children from talking\",\"To encourage children to do it\",\"To give children a prize\",\"To send children home\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In this context, promote means to encourage or support the activity.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What kind of conversations should the teacher use with the children?\",\"options\":[\"Difficult ones\",\"Similar ones\",\"Secret ones\",\"Angry ones\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text specifies \'similar conversations\'.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If a teacher asks students to act out a scene from a story, which instruction are they following?\",\"options\":[\"Promote the children to enact\",\"Give children more homework\",\"Engage children in math\",\"Promote children to sleep\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"Acting out a scene is a form of enacting, which the text encourages.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"A teacher starts a group discussion similar to the one in the book. This is an example of:\",\"options\":[\"Engaging in similar conversations\",\"Promoting silence\",\"Giving less exposure\",\"Discouraging speech\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"Starting a discussion similar to the book follows the instruction to engage in similar conversations.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these activities best fits all the instructions given in the text?\",\"options\":[\"Children reading a book silently alone\",\"Children talking and acting out a role-play\",\"Children writing the alphabet ten times\",\"Children listening to a long lecture\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Talking and acting out role-play covers communication, conversation, and enacting.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the text, what is the teacher\'s primary role during these activities?\",\"options\":[\"To be a silent observer only\",\"To actively encourage communication and action\",\"To prevent children from speaking\",\"To focus only on writing skills\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The instructions \'give exposure\', \'engage\', and \'promote\' all require the teacher to actively encourage these behaviors.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21257,5,2,'English','en','Let\'s Play the Game','[\"- The game is played with small tokens like stones, pebbles, seeds or beads.\",\"- All tokens start from the ‘Start’ point on the board.\",\"- Each player rolls a dice to decide how many spaces to move.\",\"- The picture on the board shows an action word (e.g., ‘dance’, ‘jump’).\",\"- The player must perform the action shown on the picture.\",\"- If the action is done correctly, the player moves the token to that space.\",\"- If the action is not done correctly, the token stays where it was.\",\"- After a correct action, the player must make a simple sentence using the action word.\",\"- Example: action word ‘dance’ → sentence ‘I am dancing.’\",\"- If the sentence is correct, the player gets a bonus move of one extra box.\",\"- Players take turns one after another until all members reach the winning point.\",\"- The board has numbered spaces from 1 to 34 with a ‘Start’ at the beginning.\",\"- The winning point is the last space on the board.\",\"- The game helps practice listening, acting, and sentence formation.\",\"- It encourages teamwork and turns-based play.\",\"- The game can be played in small groups or as a whole class activity.\"]','[{\"q\":\"Where should you keep the tokens at the beginning of the game?\",\"options\":[\"At the \'Finish\'\",\"At the \'Start\'\",\"In your pocket\",\"On the cell\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states to keep the tokens at the \'Start\'.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these can be used as a token according to the text?\",\"options\":[\"Erasers\",\"Pencils\",\"Beads\",\"Paper\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text mentions beads as an example of tokens.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What happens if you do the action correctly?\",\"options\":[\"You lose the game\",\"You put your token on the cell\",\"You go back to Start\",\"You give your token to a friend\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Rule number 2 says if you do the correct action, put your token on the cell.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What should you do if you fail to do the action?\",\"options\":[\"Don\'t move your token\",\"Move your token forward\",\"Pick up a new token\",\"Start the game again\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"Rule number 3 says if you fail to do the action, don\'t move your token.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If you are asked to \'smile\', what must you do to move your token?\",\"options\":[\"Make a sad face\",\"Show a happy face\",\"Close your eyes\",\"Run away\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"To move the token, you must perform the correct action, which is to smile.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which action word from the list would you use when you have a book?\",\"options\":[\"Eat\",\"Read\",\"Swim\",\"Fly\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Read is the appropriate action associated with a book from the given list.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which group contains only things mentioned as tokens in the text?\",\"options\":[\"Stones and seeds\",\"Flowers and leaves\",\"Coins and caps\",\"Sand and water\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text lists small stones, pebbles, seeds, and beads as tokens.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"How many numbered steps are given in the \'How to play?\' section?\",\"options\":[\"Two\",\"Four\",\"Three\",\"Five\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text provides three numbered instructions for playing the game.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which word comes immediately after \'Start\' in the text?\",\"options\":[\"Clap\",\"Smile\",\"Walk\",\"Jump\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"In the list of actions, \'clap\' follows the word \'Start\'.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What is the main purpose of the small stones or seeds in this game?\",\"options\":[\"To throw them at the cell\",\"To use them as tokens to track progress\",\"To count how many actions are left\",\"To decorate the game board\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The instructions explain that tokens (like stones or seeds) are moved based on actions performed.\",\"topic\":\"How to play?\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"According to the example, what sentence is made from the word \'dance\'?\",\"options\":[\"I dance well.\",\"I am dancing.\",\"She is dancing.\",\"Let\'s dance.\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly gives \'dance - I am dancing\' as the example.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What kind of word is \'dance\' called in the text?\",\"options\":[\"Naming word\",\"Action word\",\"Describing word\",\"Color word\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text refers to \'dance\' as an \'action word\'.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How many boxes ahead do you move your token if you make a sentence?\",\"options\":[\"Two boxes\",\"Three boxes\",\"One box\",\"Zero boxes\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states to \'move your token one box ahead\'.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What is the main task you need to do with the action word?\",\"options\":[\"Draw a picture\",\"Make a sentence\",\"Spell the word\",\"Find the word\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The instruction says to \'Make a sentence using given action word\'.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What do you receive as a \'bonus point\' in this game?\",\"options\":[\"Moving your token one box ahead\",\"A new action word\",\"A dance\",\"A new token\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"Moving the token one box ahead is described as a bonus point.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If the action word is \'run\', how should you make the sentence following the example?\",\"options\":[\"I run fast.\",\"I am running.\",\"He runs.\",\"Running is good.\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Following the pattern \'dance - I am dancing\', \'run\' becomes \'I am running\'.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"If the action word is \'read\', which sentence follows the rule shown in the text?\",\"options\":[\"I am reading.\",\"I like books.\",\"Read the book.\",\"The book is red.\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The example shows adding \'I am\' and \'-ing\' to the action word.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"What is the requirement to move your token ahead?\",\"options\":[\"Just saying the word\",\"Being able to make a sentence\",\"Waiting for your turn\",\"Dancing like the example\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text says \'If you are able to make a sentence, move your token\'.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the rules, what happens right after you successfully make a sentence?\",\"options\":[\"The game ends\",\"You lose a turn\",\"Your token moves one box forward\",\"You pick a new word\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The rule states that making a sentence allows you to move your token one box ahead.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these best describes the \'bonus point\' rule?\",\"options\":[\"It rewards players for making sentences.\",\"It punishes players who cannot dance.\",\"It makes the game longer.\",\"It changes the action word.\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The bonus point is a reward for the specific skill of making a sentence.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21258,5,2,'English','en','World of the Alphabet','[\"Alphabet is a set of letters that help us write words.\",\"The English alphabet has 26 letters from A to Z.\",\"Letters are written in a specific order called alphabetical order.\",\"We can arrange words in alphabetical order by looking at their first letters.\",\"If two words start with the same letter, we look at the next letter to decide the order.\",\"The alphabet is used in dictionaries, books, and lists to keep things organized.\",\"Each letter has a capital (uppercase) and a small (lowercase) form.\",\"The alphabet is the building block of all English words.\",\"When we write a word, we use letters in the order they appear in the word.\",\"Learning the alphabet helps us read and write correctly.\",\"The alphabet is the same for all English speakers worldwide.\",\"We can make alphabet cards to practice writing and recognizing letters.\",\"Alphabetical order is useful for sorting names, books, and other items.\",\"The alphabet starts with A and ends with Z.\",\"Knowing the alphabet helps us find words in a dictionary quickly.\"]','[{\"q\":\"Which of these words starts with the letter \'A\' in the given text?\",\"options\":[\"apple\",\"ball\",\"cap\",\"duck\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text lists \'apple\' as one of the words starting with the letter \'A\'.\",\"topic\":\"Look, listen and learn (A-I)\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which animal is mentioned in the list for the letter \'D\'?\",\"options\":[\"cow\",\"fish\",\"donkey\",\"goat\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text lists \'donkey\' under the letter \'D\'.\",\"topic\":\"Look, listen and learn (A-I)\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Arrange the following letters in alphabetical order: c, a, b.\",\"options\":[\"c, b, a\",\"a, b, c\",\"b, a, c\",\"a, c, b\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Alphabetical order follows the sequence of the alphabet: a, b, c.\",\"topic\":\"Look, listen and learn (A-I)\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which group of words all start with the letter \'E\'?\",\"options\":[\"face, fan, fish, four\",\"gate, gift, goat, grapes\",\"earth, egg, eight, eraser\",\"ice-cream, igloo, injection, inkpot\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text lists earth, egg, eight, and eraser under the letter \'E\'.\",\"topic\":\"Look, listen and learn (A-I)\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which object is a fruit?\",\"options\":[\"aeroplane\",\"apple\",\"arrow\",\"axe\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The figure for letter \'A\' shows an apple, which is a fruit.\",\"topic\":\"Look, listen and learn (A-I)\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\",\"figure_image\":\"5\\/016_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which object is shown as being open?\",\"options\":[\"baby\",\"ball\",\"bell\",\"box\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"The figure for letter \'B\' shows an open box.\",\"topic\":\"Look, listen and learn (A-I)\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\",\"figure_image\":\"5\\/016_102.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"Which word starts with the letter \'I\' in the text?\",\"options\":[\"egg\",