explain\":\"The text explicitly states that in the number 73, the face value of digit 7 is 7.\",\"topic\":\"Face Value and Place Value\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 18, what is the face value of the digit 1?\",\"options\":[\"10\",\"1\",\"8\",\"18\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"According to the text, in the number 18, the face value of digit 1 is 1.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 27, what is the face value of the digit 7?\",\"options\":[\"2\",\"20\",\"7\",\"70\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states that in the number 27, the face value of digit 7 is 7.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 24, which digit is in the ten\'s place?\",\"options\":[\"4\",\"2\",\"20\",\"24\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly mentions that in the number 24, digit 2 is in the ten\'s place.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 13, the digit 1 is in the ten\'s place. What is its place value?\",\"options\":[\"1\",\"3\",\"10\",\"13\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states that 1 ten is 10, so the place value of 1 in the ten\'s place is 10.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 24, the digit 4 is in the unit\'s place. What is its place value?\",\"options\":[\"40\",\"20\",\"2\",\"4\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"The text states that 4 units is 4, so the place value of 4 in the unit\'s place is 4.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If a digit is in the ten\'s place and it is 2, what is its place value?\",\"options\":[\"2\",\"20\",\"4\",\"24\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The table shows that 2 tens is 20.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 13, how many units are there?\",\"options\":[\"1 unit\",\"10 units\",\"3 units\",\"13 units\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The table for the number 13 shows that there are 3 units.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"If we have the number 24, what does \'2 tens\' represent?\",\"options\":[\"2\",\"4\",\"20\",\"24\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states \'2 tens is 20\' for the number 24.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Looking at the number 24, which digit has the higher place value?\",\"options\":[\"The digit 4\",\"The digit 2\",\"Both have the same place value\",\"Neither digit has a place value\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Digit 2 has a place value of 20, while digit 4 has a place value of 4; 20 is higher than 4.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 13, if the digit in the ten\'s place is changed to 2, what would its new place value be?\",\"options\":[\"2\",\"10\",\"20\",\"23\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Based on the pattern for the number 24, 2 in the ten\'s place has a place value of 20.\",\"topic\":\"Place value of a digit\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What is the face value of the digit 2 in the number 29?\",\"options\":[\"20\",\"2\",\"9\",\"29\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states that in number 29, the face value of digit 2 is 2.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How many digits are there in the number 29?\",\"options\":[\"One\",\"Two\",\"Three\",\"Nine\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly mentions that 29 is a two-digit number.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 29, what is the place value of the digit 2?\",\"options\":[\"2\",\"9\",\"20\",\"29\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"According to the text, the place value of digit 2 in 29 is 20.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What determines the place value of a digit in a number?\",\"options\":[\"The face value\",\"The number 29\",\"The place of the digit\",\"The units place\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states that in a number, the place of a digit determines its place value.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If a digit is in the \'Tens\' place and its place value is 20, how many tens does it represent?\",\"options\":[\"2 Tens\",\"20 Tens\",\"9 Tens\",\"0 Tens\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The table shows that 2 Tens is equal to 20.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 29, which digit is in the \'Units\' place?\",\"options\":[\"2\",\"20\",\"9\",\"0\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The table shows that 9 is in the Units column for the number 29.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which of the following is true for the digit 9 in the number 29?\",\"options\":[\"Its place value is 90\",\"Its face value is 2\",\"Its place value is 9\",\"Its face value is 20\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states that the place value of digit 9 is 9.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What is the face value of the digit 9 in the number 29?\",\"options\":[\"90\",\"9\",\"2\",\"29\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states that in number 29, the face value of digit 9 is 9.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"According to the table, 2 Tens and 9 Units together make which number?\",\"options\":[\"92\",\"20\",\"29\",\"11\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The table and text show that 2 Tens and 9 Units represent the number 29.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If the place of a digit changes, which of the following also changes according to the text?\",\"options\":[\"The face value\",\"The place value\",\"The digit itself\",\"Nothing changes\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text says the place of a digit determines its place value, implying it changes if the place changes.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21330,7,2,'Maths','en','Face Value and Place Value','[\"Face value of a digit is the digit itself, no matter where it is in the number.\",\"Place value of a digit depends on its position in the number.\",\"In a two-digit number, the place value of the tens digit is digit × 10.\",\"In a two-digit number, the place value of the units digit is digit × 1.\",\"Example: In 29, face value of 2 is 2, place value is 20; face value of 9 is 9, place value is 9.\",\"Expanded form shows the number as sum of place values, e.g., 29 = 20 + 9.\",\"To compare two-digit numbers, first compare the tens digit.\",\"If tens digits are equal, compare the units digit.\",\"The number with the greater tens digit is the greater number.\",\"If tens and units digits are both equal, the numbers are equal.\",\"We use symbols: > means greater than, < means less than, = means equal to.\",\"Zero has face value 0 and place value 0 in any position.\",\"The place value of 0 is always 0, whether it is in tens or units place.\",\"Numbers from 10 to 99 are two-digit numbers.\",\"In number 50, place value of 5 is 50 and place value of 0 is 0.\"]','[{\"q\":\"In the number 56, what is the place value of the digit 5?\",\"options\":[\"5\",\"50\",\"6\",\"60\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In a two-digit number, the digit in the tens place (5) has a place value of 50.\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these numbers from the text has a digit with a place value of 8?\",\"options\":[\"87\",\"98\",\"80\",\"18\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In the number 98, the digit 8 is in the units place, so its place value is 8.\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 75, what is the face value of the digit 7?\",\"options\":[\"70\",\"7\",\"5\",\"75\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The face value of a digit is the digit itself, regardless of its place.\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"If you need to write a number where the place value of 7 is 70, which number is correct?\",\"options\":[\"87\",\"75\",\"17\",\"7\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In 75, 7 is in the tens place, making its place value 70.\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 73, what is the place value of the digit 3?\",\"options\":[\"30\",\"3\",\"7\",\"70\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The digit 3 is in the units place, so its place value is 3.\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What is the place value of the digit 0 in the number 40?\",\"options\":[\"40\",\"4\",\"0\",\"10\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The digit 0 in the units place always has a place value of 0.\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 69, what is the face value of the digit 6?\",\"options\":[\"60\",\"6\",\"9\",\"69\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The face value of 6 is simply 6.\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which number has the digit 3 in a position where its place value is 30?\",\"options\":[\"73\",\"31\",\"3\",\"13\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In 31, the digit 3 is in the tens place, so its place value is 30.\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Look at the number 87. What are the place values of 8 and 7?\",\"options\":[\"8 and 7\",\"80 and 70\",\"80 and 7\",\"8 and 70\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"8 is in the tens place (80) and 7 is in the units place (7).\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"To make the place value of a digit ten times its face value, in which place should we write it?\",\"options\":[\"Units place\",\"Tens place\",\"Face place\",\"Zero place\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Writing a digit in the tens place makes its place value ten times its face value (e.g., 5 becomes 50).\",\"topic\":\"Write any two-digit number\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 62, what is the place value of the digit 6?\",\"options\":[\"6\",\"60\",\"2\",\"20\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In the number 62, 6 is in the tens place, so its place value is 60.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 29, what is the place value of the digit 9?\",\"options\":[\"90\",\"20\",\"9\",\"2\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"In the number 29, 9 is in the units place, so its place value is 9.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 17, which digit is in the tens place?\",\"options\":[\"7\",\"1\",\"10\",\"17\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In the number 17, 1 is the digit in the tens place.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"The statement \'In the number 29, place value of the digit 9 is 90\' is:\",\"options\":[\"True\",\"False\",\"Correct\",\"Right\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The place value of 9 in 29 is 9, not 90, because it is in the units place.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 17, why is the place value of the digit 1 equal to 10?\",\"options\":[\"Because it is in the units place\",\"Because it is the first digit\",\"Because it is in the tens place\",\"Because 1 plus 7 is 8\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Digits in the tens place represent multiples of ten.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What is the correct place value of the digit 3 in the number 38?\",\"options\":[\"3\",\"8\",\"30\",\"80\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"In 38, the digit 3 is in the tens place, so its value is 30.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which sign should be put in the box for the statement: \'In the number 62, place value of the digit 6 is 60\'?\",\"options\":[\"✕\",\"✓\",\"=\",\"+\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The statement is true, so the proper sign is ✓.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"If a student writes ✓ for the statement \'In the number 38, place value of the digit 3 is 3\', is the student correct?\",\"options\":[\"Yes, it is true\",\"No, they should write ✕\",\"Yes, because 3 is a digit\",\"No, they should write 60\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The statement is false because the place value of 3 in 38 is 30, so the sign should be ✕.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these statements about the number 17 is correct according to the exercise?\",\"options\":[\"Place value of 1 is 1\",\"Place value of 7 is 70\",\"Place value of 1 is 10\",\"Place value of 7 is 1\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"In 17, 1 is in the tens place (10) and 7 is in the units place (7).\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the exercise, which number has a digit in the tens place with a place value of 60?\",\"options\":[\"29\",\"17\",\"38\",\"62\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"In the number 62, the digit 6 is in the tens place, making its value 60.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21331,7,2,'Maths','en','Comparing Numbers','[\"To compare two-digit numbers, first check the tens digit.\",\"If tens digits are different, the number with the greater tens digit is larger.\",\"If tens digits are the same, compare the units digits.\",\"The number with the greater units digit is larger when tens are equal.\",\"Use symbols: > means greater than, < means less than, = means equal to.\",\"Example: 63 > 61 because tens are equal (6=6) and 3 > 1.\",\"To find the greatest number in a set, compare tens first, then units if needed.\",\"To find the smallest number, look for the smallest tens digit, then smallest units if tied.\",\"Ascending order means arranging from smallest to largest.\",\"Descending order means arranging from largest to smallest.\",\"When forming two-digit numbers from digits, place the larger digit in tens place for greatest number.\",\"Place the smaller digit in tens place for smallest number (if not zero; if zero, avoid leading zero).\",\"With digits a and b, the two possible numbers are ab and ba (if a≠b and neither is zero leading).\",\"If one digit is 0, only numbers where 0 is in units place are valid two-digit numbers (e.g., 50, not 05).\",\"Practice with digit cards helps understand number formation and comparison.\"]','[{\"q\":\"Which symbol is used to show that a number is \'greater than\' another number?\",\"options\":[\"<\",\">\",\"=\",\"+\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states that \'25 is greater than 19\' is written as 25 > 19.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 19, which digit is in the tens place?\",\"options\":[\"9\",\"1\",\"19\",\"0\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"According to the table in the text, 1 is in the Tens place for the number 19.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How many beads does Rama have in the example?\",\"options\":[\"13 beads\",\"9 beads\",\"25 beads\",\"19 beads\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly mentions \'Rama has 9 beads\'.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"When comparing two-digit numbers, which digit should we look at to find the greater number?\",\"options\":[\"Units digit\",\"Tens digit\",\"The last digit\",\"The zero digit\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states: \'In two-digit numbers, the number with the greater tens digit is greater.\'\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What does the symbol \'<\' mean in the expression \'19 < 25\'?\",\"options\":[\"19 is greater than 25\",\"19 is equal to 25\",\"19 is smaller than or less than 25\",\"19 is the same as 25\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text explains that 19 < 25 means 19 is smaller than or less than 25.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Between the numbers 2 and 9, which one is the smaller number?\",\"options\":[\"9\",\"2\",\"11\",\"7\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In the revision section, 2 is identified as the smaller number when compared to 9.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If you compare 25 and 19, which number is greater?\",\"options\":[\"19\",\"25\",\"9\",\"5\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text concludes that 25 is greater than 19 because its tens digit is larger.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which is the smaller number in the pair 4 and 7?\",\"options\":[\"7\",\"4\",\"11\",\"3\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Based on the revision section, 4 is the smaller number compared to 7.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Why is 25 greater than 19 according to the rule in the text?\",\"options\":[\"Because 5 is greater than 9\",\"Because the tens digit 2 is greater than the tens digit 1\",\"Because 19 comes after 25\",\"Because 25 has fewer beads\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explains that in two-digit numbers, the number with the greater tens digit is greater.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Rama has 9 beads and Geeta has 13 beads. Which statement is correct?\",\"options\":[\"Rama has more beads\",\"Geeta has more beads\",\"They have the same number of beads\",\"9 is greater than 13\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states: \'Geeta has 13 beads. Geeta has more beads.\'\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these is the correct way to write \'13 is greater than 9\' using a symbol?\",\"options\":[\"13 < 9\",\"13 = 9\",\"13 > 9\",\"9 > 13\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Following the logic of \'25 > 19\', \'13 is greater than 9\' is written as 13 > 9.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"What is the smaller number in the box containing 3 and 6?\",\"options\":[\"6\",\"3\",\"9\",\"0\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In the revision section, 3 is the smaller number compared to 6.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Tens Digit\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"If the digits in the tens place are equal, which place should we look at to compare the numbers?\",\"options\":[\"Units place\",\"Hundreds place\",\"Tens place\",\"None of these\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text states that if the tens place digits are equal, we look at the digits in the units place.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Units Digit\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which symbol is used to show that 18 is greater than 15?\",\"options\":[\"18 < 15\",\"18 = 15\",\"18 > 15\",\"18 + 15\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text mentions that \'18 is greater than 15\' is written as 18 > 15.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Units Digit\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"According to the text, if the digits in the tens place are equal, which number is greater?\",\"options\":[\"The number with the smaller units place\",\"The number with the greater units place\",\"The number with the same units place\",\"The number with zero in units place\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The rule stated is that if tens digits are equal, the number with the greater units place is greater.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Units Digit\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, how many beads are shown in the top row altogether?\",\"options\":[\"10 beads\",\"15 beads\",\"18 beads\",\"5 beads\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The figure and text show that the top row represents 15 beads (1 ten and 5 units).\",\