arison of units is true?\",\"options\":[\"5 < 8\",\"5 > 8\",\"5 = 8\",\"8 < 5\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text shows 5 < 8 as the reason why 15 is less than 18.\",\"topic\":\"Comparing Units Digit\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"According to the text, what is the tens digit in the number 27?\",\"options\":[\"7\",\"2\",\"27\",\"0\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The table for comparing 27 and 32 shows that 27 has 2 in the Tens column.\",\"topic\":\"Worked Examples\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which number is listed as the \'Number with greater tens digit\'?\",\"options\":[\"27\",\"7\",\"2\",\"32\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"The table shows that 32 has 3 tens, which is greater than the 2 tens in 27.\",\"topic\":\"Worked Examples\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\",\"figure_image\":\"7\\/027_102.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"If 32 is greater than 27, how is this written using a symbol in the text?\",\"options\":[\"32 < 27\",\"32 = 27\",\"32 > 27\",\"27 > 32\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly states \'32 is greater than 27 hence, 32 > 27\'.\",\"topic\":\"Worked Examples\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, why are the unit digits compared to find the greater number?\",\"options\":[\"Because the tens digits are equal\",\"Because the unit digits are equal\",\"Because 63 is always greater than 61\",\"Because there are no tens digits\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The figure notes that we compare unit digits \'as tens digits are equal\' (both are 6).\",\"topic\":\"Worked Examples\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\",\"figure_image\":\"7\\/028_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"In the number 61, what is the digit in the units place?\",\"options\":[\"6\",\"61\",\"1\",\"3\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The table for 63 and 61 shows that 61 has 1 in the Units column.\",\"topic\":\"Worked Examples\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"When comparing 63 and 61, which number has the greater unit digit?\",\"o