 takes too long to add using a number strip.\",\"The number strip is only for subtraction.\",\"The number strip has no numbers.\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly says, \'It takes too long to add using number strip.\'\",\"topic\":\"Arrangement for addition\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"How many tens are there in the number 25 according to the strings and beads method?\",\"options\":[\"5 tens\",\"1 ten\",\"3 tens\",\"2 tens\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"The text describes 25 as \'2 tens 5 units\'.\",\"topic\":\"Arrangement for addition\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which digit is placed in the \'Units\' column for the number 14?\",\"options\":[\"1\",\"4\",\"5\",\"9\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In the vertical arrangement table, the digit 4 is placed under the \'Units\' column for the second number.\",\"topic\":\"Arrangement for addition\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\",\"figure_image\":\"7\\/037_105.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"What is the name of the arrangement where the sum is written as 25 + 14 = 39?\",\"options\":[\"Vertical arrangement\",\"Circular arrangement\",\"Horizontal arrangement\",\"Square arrangement\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text labels \'25 + 14 = 39\' as the Horizontal arrangement.\",\"topic\":\"Arrangement for addition\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"When adding 25 and 14 using strings and beads, how many units do we get in total?\",\"options\":[\"5 units\",\"4 units\",\"9 units\",\"3 units\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text shows 5 units plus 4 units equals 9 units.\",\"topic\":\"Arrangement for addition\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what is the total number of \'Tens\' shown in the answer row of the vertical arrangement?\",\"options\":[\"2\",\"1\",\"3\",\"9\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The bottom row of the \'Tens\' column in the vertical arrangement shows the number 3.\",\"topic\":\"Arrangement for addition\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\",\"figure_image\":\"7\\/037_105.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"What columns are used to organize digits in a \'Vertical arrangement\' as shown in the text?\",\"options\":[\"Tens and Units\",\"Hundreds and Tens\",\"Left and Right\",\"Big and Small\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The vertical arrangement table uses the headings \'Tens\' and \'Units\'.\",\"topic\":\"Arrangement for addition\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If you have 3 tens and 9 units, what number does it make?\",\"options\":[\"30\",\"93\",\"39\",\"12\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text concludes that 3 tens 9 units is 39.\",\"topic\":\"Arrangement for addition\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which method involves writing numbers one below the other in columns?\",\"options\":[\"Number strip\",\"Horizontal arrangement\",\"Vertical arrangement\",\"Loose beads only\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text shows the vertical arrangement as numbers placed in Tens and Units columns.\",\"topic\":\"Arrangement for addition\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the addition table shown in the text, what does the letter \'T\' stand for?\",\"options\":[\"Total\",\"Tens\",\"Two\",\"Triple\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text uses \'T\' and \'U\' to represent Tens and Units in the addition tables.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the addition table shown in the text, what does the letter \'U\' stand for?\",\"options\":[\"Units\",\"Under\",\"Up\",\"Uniform\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text uses \'U\' to represent Units in the horizontal and vertical arrangements.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"According to the text, what is the result of 25 + 14?\",\"options\":[\"29\",\"34\",\"39\",\"49\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly shows the calculation 25 + 14 = 39.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the horizontal arrangement 25 + 14 = 39, which digit is in the Tens place of the answer?\",\"options\":[\"9\",\"5\",\"4\",\"3\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"In the number 39, 3 is in the Tens (T) place and 9 is in the Units (U) place.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"When solving 25 + 14, which two digits are added together to get the Units place of the answer?\",\"options\":[\"2 and 1\",\"5 and 4\",\"2 and 4\",\"5 and 1\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"To find the units of the sum, we add the units of the numbers: 5 + 4 = 9.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What is the sum of 34 + 12 using horizontal arrangement?\",\"options\":[\"46\",\"36\",\"42\",\"56\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"Adding tens (3+1=4) and units (4+2=6) gives 46.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Solve the following addition mentioned in the text: 15 + 23 = ?\",\"options\":[\"35\",\"28\",\"38\",\"48\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Adding tens (1+2=3) and units (5+3=8) gives 38.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Solve the following addition mentioned in the text: 41 + 26 = ?\",\"options\":[\"66\",\"67\",\"57\",\"77\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Adding tens (4+2=6) and units (1+6=7) gives 67.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"If you add 22 + 10 horizontally, how many Tens (T) will be in your answer?\",\"options\":[\"2\",\"1\",\"0\",\"3\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"Adding the tens digits 2 and 1 results in 3 tens.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"The text suggests using \'blocks of tens\' and \'unit blocks\'. To represent the number 25, how many blocks of tens are needed?\",\"options\":[\"5\",\"2\",\"7\",\"3\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The number 25 has 2 in the tens place, so it requires 2 blocks of tens.\",\"topic\":\"Addition (By Horizontal arrangement)\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21334,7,2,'Maths','en','Addition','[\"Addition means putting numbers together to find the total.\",\"The numbers we add are called addends.\",\"The result of addition is called the sum.\",\"The symbol for addition is \'+\'.\",\"Adding zero to any number gives the same number.\",\"The order of numbers in addition does not change the sum.\",\"4 + 5 = 9 and 5 + 4 = 9 – both give the same answer.\",\"We can add more than two numbers, like 2 + 3 + 4 = 9.\",\"Counting on fingers or using objects helps in addition.\",\"Addition is used to find total things when groups are combined.\",\"Start from the bigger number and count forward for easier addition.\",\"Addition facts up to 10 should be remembered for quick solving.\",\"When adding, we combine quantities to know how many in all.\",\"Addition is the opposite of subtraction.\",\"We write addition as: addend + addend = sum.\"]','[{\"q\":\"How many laddus does Raju have in the story?\",\"options\":[\"5 laddus\",\"4 laddus\",\"9 laddus\",\"1 laddu\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states \'Raju has 4 laddus.\'\",\"topic\":\"Changing the Order\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How many laddus does Meena have?\",\"options\":[\"4 laddus\",\"9 laddus\",\"5 laddus\",\"0 laddus\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states \'Meena has 5 laddus.\'\",\"topic\":\"Changing the Order\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Where did Raju and Meena keep their laddus?\",\"options\":[\"In a plate\",\"In a bag\",\"In a box\",\"In a jar\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text mentions they kept their laddus \'in a box\'.\",\"topic\":\"Changing the Order\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"When 4 laddus and 5 laddus are put together, what is the total number of laddus?\",\"options\":[\"8\",\"9\",\"10\",\"7\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text shows the calculation 4 + 5 = 9.\",\"topic\":\"Changing the Order\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what happens to the sum when the order of numbers is changed while adding?\",\"options\":[\"The sum changes\",\"The sum becomes zero\",\"The sum does not change\",\"The sum becomes smaller\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The figure states that \'changing the order of numbers does not change the sum.\'\",\"topic\":\"Changing the Order\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"analyze\",\"figure_image\":\"7\\/040_102.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the given figure, what happens to the answer when we change the order of numbers?\",\"options\":[\"The answer remains the same\",\"The answer becomes double\",\"The answer becomes different\",\"The answer is wrong\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The figure explicitly says \'the answer remains the same.\'\",\"topic\":\"Changing the Order\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\",\"figure_image\":\"7\\/040_102.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"If 4 + 5 = 9, then what is the total when we add 5 + 4?\",\"options\":[\"10\",\"1\",\"9\",\"54\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text shows that 5 + 4 = 9, demonstrating the order does not change the sum.\",\"topic\":\"Changing the Order\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Meena puts her 5 laddus in the box first, and then Raju puts his 4 laddus. How many laddus are in the box now?\",\"options\":[\"9\",\"4\",\"5\",\"1\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text states that Meena\'s (5) + Raju\'s (4) = 9.\",\"topic\":\"Changing the Order\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these addition sentences shows that changing the order gives the same answer?\",\"options\":[\"4 + 5 = 9 and 5 + 4 = 9\",\"4 + 5 = 9 and 4 + 4 = 8\",\"5 + 5 = 10 and 4 + 4 = 8\",\"4 + 0 = 4 and 5 + 0 = 5\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text uses 4+5 and 5+4 to show that the sum 9 remains the same.\",\"topic\":\"Changing the Order\",\"