,\"options\":[\"1 hour\",\"2 hours\",\"8 hours\",\"9 hours\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The duration between 8 o\'clock and the very next hour (9 o\'clock) is 1 hour.\",\"topic\":\"Measuring Hours\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If a student starts homework at afternoon 1 o\'clock and finishes at afternoon 3 o\'clock, how many hours did they spend?\",\"options\":[\"1 hour\",\"2 hours\",\"3 hours\",\"4 hours\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"From 1 to 2 is 1 hour, and 2 to 3 is another hour, making it 2 hours.\",\"topic\":\"Measuring Hours\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Calculate the number of hours from evening 4 o\'clock to evening 7 o\'clock.\",\"options\":[\"2 hours\",\"3 hours\",\"4 hours\",\"7 hours\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Counting the hours: 4 to 5 (1), 5 to 6 (2), 6 to 7 (3).\",\"topic\":\"Measuring Hours\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"A family starts a journey at morning 6 o\'clock and reaches their destination at morning 11 o\'clock. How many hours did they travel?\",\"options\":[\"4 hours\",\"5 hours\",\"6 hours\",\"11 hours\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Counting from 6 to 11 gives 5 hours.\",\"topic\":\"Measuring Hours\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"To find the time from 4 o\'clock to 6 o\'clock, we count 4 to 5 as 1 hour and 5 to 6 as 1 hour. What is the total duration?\",\"options\":[\"1 hour\",\"2 hours\",\"6 hours\",\"10 hours\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Adding the two 1-hour segments mentioned in the text results in 2 hours.\",\"topic\":\"Measuring Hours\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"If morning 6 to morning 10 is 4 hours, how many hours is morning 6 to morning 11?\",\"options\":[\"3 hours\",\"4 hours\",\"5 hours\",\"6 hours\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Adding one more hour to the 4-hour duration (6 to 10) makes it 5 hours (6 to 11).\",\"topic\":\"Measuring Hours\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these time durations mentioned in the text is the longest?\",\"options\":[\"Afternoon 1 to afternoon 3\",\"Evening 4 to evening 7\",\"Night 8 to night 9\",\"Morning 6 to morning 11\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"Morning 6 to 11 is 5 hours, which is longer than 2, 3, or 1 hour durations.\",\"topic\":\"Measuring Hours\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"How many hours are there in one day?\",\"options\":[\"12 hours\",\"24 hours\",\"60 hours\",\"10 hours\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The teacher states that 24 hours = 1 day.\",\"topic\":\"One Day\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What is the period from one fixed time today to the same time on the next day called?\",\"options\":[\"One hour\",\"One week\",\"One day\",\"One month\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The teacher defines the period from a fixed time today to the same time tomorrow as \'one day\'.\",\"topic\":\"One Day\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"At what time did Rahul say the school started today?\",\"options\":[\"8 o’clock\",\"9 o’clock\",\"10 o’clock\",\"12 o’clock\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Rahul said the school started at 9 o’clock in the morning.\",\"topic\":\"One Day\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"If school starts at 9 o\'clock today, what time will it start tomorrow according to Sonal?\",\"options\":[\"9 o’clock\",\"10 o’clock\",\"8 o’clock\",\"12 o’clock\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"Sonal says that tomorrow also the school will start at 9 o’clock.\",\"topic\":\"One Day\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"According to the teacher, 24 hours is equal to how many days?\",\"options\":[\"1 day\",\"2 days\",\"24 days\",\"7 days\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly states that 24 hours = 1 day.\",\"topic\":\"One Day\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"From 9 o’clock this morning to 9 o’clock tomorrow morning is how many hours?\",\"options\":[\"9 hours\",\"12 hours\",\"24 hours\",\"48 hours\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The teacher explains that from 9 o’clock today to 9 o’clock tomo