?\",\"options\":[\"rocket\",\"astronaut\",\"earth\",\"gravity\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"An astronaut is a person trained to travel in a spacecraft.\",\"topic\":\"House of Words - 4\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which word appears in the very first box of the first column?\",\"options\":[\"watermelon\",\"astronaut\",\"strawberries\",\"learning\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The word \'strawberries\' is at the top-left corner of the table.\",\"topic\":\"House of Words - 4\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\",\"figure_image\":\"11\\/094_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"Which word from the list is an action word ending with the suffix \'-ing\'?\",\"options\":[\"dream\",\"dreaming\",\"dreamers\",\"dreams\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"\'Dreaming\' is the only word in the list that ends with \'-ing\'.\",\"topic\":\"House of Words - 4\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which word describes the loud sound made by a wild animal like a lion?\",\"options\":[\"cub\",\"den\",\"roar\",\"wild\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"A lion is known for its loud \'roar\'.\",\"topic\":\"House of Words - 4\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which word is in the same row as \'rocket\' and \'sunlight\'?\",\"options\":[\"control\",\"pollution\",\"earth\",\"energy\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The fifth row contains sunlight, rocket, cub, control, and wild.\",\"topic\":\"House of Words - 4\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\",\"figure_image\":\"11\\/094_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"Which word from the list means \'happening without any delay\'?\",\"options\":[\"immediately\",\"favourite\",\"national\",\"different\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"\'Immediately\' means to do something right away.\",\"topic\":\"House of Words - 4\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which word from the list is related to a place with many trees and wild animals?\",\"options\":[\"puzzle\",\"forest\",\"suit\",\"amount\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"A forest is a large area covered with trees and undergrowth.\",\"topic\":\"House of Words - 4\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"If a person is not clear about what is happening, which word from the list describes their state?\",\"options\":[\"calm\",\"helpful\",\"confused\",\"beautiful\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Being \'confused\' means being unable to think clearly or understand something.\",\"topic\":\"House of Words - 4\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What is the name for a baby lion as mentioned in the list?\",\"options\":[\"forest\",\"den\",\"cub\",\"sharp\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"A \'cub\' is the young one of a lion, bear, or wolf.\",\"topic\":\"House of Words - 4\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What is the national 24-hour toll-free emergency phone number for children in distress?\",\"options\":[\"100\",\"1098\",\"101\",\"108\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states that CHILDLINE 1098 is a national 24 hours toll free emergency phone service for children in distress.\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which organization can you inform through the POCSO e-box if you feel uneasy about an inappropriate touch?\",\"options\":[\"Ministry of Finance\",\"National Commission for Protection of Child Rights\",\"Local Police Station\",\"School Board\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text mentions informing the National Commission for Protection of Child Rights through the POCSO e-box.\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"If you receive an unsafe touch, what should you NOT do according to the safety message?\",\"options\":[\"Tell someone you trust\",\"Keep quiet\",\"Inform the NCPCR\",\"Call 1098\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly says \'you should not keep quiet\' if you feel uneasy about someone touching you inappropriately.\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Why does the text say you need not feel \'bad\' if you get an unsafe touch?\",\"options\":[\"Because it is a secret\",\"Because it is not your fault\",\"Because you are young\",\"Because it happens to everyone\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text says, \'You need not feel \\\"bad\\\" because it’s not your fault.\'\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"A child is 10 years old and is feeling troubled. According to the text, what action can they take?\",\"options\":[\"Keep it to themselves\",\"Call 1098\",\"Blame themselves\",\"Wait until they are 18\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states if you are below 18 years of age and are troubled, you can call 1098.\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"To whom should a child report an inappropriate touch?\",\"options\":[\"A stranger on the street\",\"Someone they trust\",\"No one at all\",\"A younger sibling\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text advises children to \'Tell someone whom you trust.\'\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which feelings might a child experience when they get an unsafe touch, according to the text?\",\"options\":[\"Happy, excited, and energetic\",\"Bad, confused, and helpless\",\"Strong, brave, and angry\",\"Sleepy, hungry, and tired\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states, \'When you get an unsafe touch, you may feel bad, confused and helpless.\'\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Why does the text describe 1098 as a \'good\' number?\",\"options\":[\"Because it is easy to remember\",\"Because it is a lucky number\",\"Because it changes lives\",\"Because it is a large number\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text says \'Call 1098...because some numbers are good! They change lives!!!\'\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"Which Ministry supports the CHILDLINE India Foundation?\",\"options\":[\"Ministry of Home Affairs\",\"Ministry of Education\",\"Ministry of Women & Child Development\",\"Ministry of External Affairs\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text mentions CHILDLINE is supported by the Ministry of Women & Child Development.\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What is the meaning of \'toll free\' in the context of the CHILDLINE service?\",\"options\":[\"You have to pay for the call\",\"The call is free of cost\",\"The call is only for adults\",\"The call only works at night\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"A toll-free emergency phone service means the caller does not have to pay for the call.\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what is the specific name of the red and black circular button shown?\",\"options\":[\"Safety Box\",\"POCSO e-box\",\"NCPCR Circle\",\"Help Button\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The image shows a circular logo with the words \'POCSO e-box\' written in the center.\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\",\"figure_image\":\"11\\/095_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what action are the two children encouraging you to do regarding the e-box?\",\"options\":[\"Draw This Picture\",\"Press This Button\",\"Color This Box\",\"Close This Box\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text at the bottom of the image explicitly says \'Press This Button\' while the children point at the e-box.\",\"topic\":\"Safety Message\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\",\"figure_image\":\"11\\/095_101.jpg\"}]','vertex/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21423,12,3,'Marathi','mr','शोधिसी मानवा (प्रार्थना)','[\"शोधिसी मानवा म्हणजे प्रार्थना करणे\",\"प्रार्थना म्हणजे देवाला आपली इच्छा सांगणे\",\"शोधिसी मानवा मध्ये आपण देवाला आशीर्वाद मागतो\",\"प्रार्थना करताना मन शांत ठेवावे\",\"प्रार्थना करताना हात जोडून नम्रतेने बोलावे\",\"शोधिसी मानवा मध्ये ‘वंदना’ शब्द वापरला जातो\",\"वंदना म्हणजे देवाला प्रणाम करणे\",\"प्रार्थनेत ‘आशीर्वाद’ शब्द येतो\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘धन्यवाद’ म्हणणे चांगले\",\"शोधिसी मानवा मध्ये ‘देव’ आणि ‘भक्त’ हे शब्द येतात\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘सुख’ आणि ‘शांती’ मागणे सामान्य आहे\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘सत्कार’ आणि ‘धर्म’ यांचा उल्लेख होतो\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘भक्ती’ आणि ‘विश्वास’ महत्त्वाचे आहेत\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘आत्मा’ आणि ‘हृदय’ यांचा समावेश होतो\",\"शोधिसी मानवा मध्ये ‘प्रार्थना’ आणि ‘वंदना’ हे दोन्ही शब्द एकत्र वापरले जातात\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘संगीत’ किंवा ‘भजन’ गाणे उपयुक्त असते\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘सत्कर्म’ आणि ‘दान’ यांचा उल्लेख होतो\",\"शोधिसी मानवा मध्ये ‘देव’ आणि ‘भक्त’ यांच्यातील प्रेम दाखवले जाते\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘सत्य’ आणि ‘निष्ठा’ महत्त्वाचे आहेत\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘भक्ती’ आणि ‘भक्त’ यांचा संबंध स्पष्ट होतो\",\"शोधिसी मानवा मध्ये ‘सुख’ आणि ‘शांती’ यांचा शोध घेतला जातो\",\"प्रार्थना करताना ‘सामंजस्य’ आणि ‘सद्भावना’ यांचा उल्लेख होतो\",\"शोधिसी मानवा मध्ये ‘देव’ आणि ‘भक्त’ यांच्यातील संवाद दाखवला जातो\",\"शोधिसी मानवा मध्ये ‘प्रार्थना’ आणि ‘वंदना’ हे दोन्ही शब्द एकत्र वापरले जातात\"]','[{\"q\":\"कवीच्या मते देव कोठे नांदतो?\",\"options\":[\"राउळी मंदिरी\",\"आपुल्या अंतरी\",\"इंद्रधनुत\",\"पंढरीत\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"कवितेच्या ध्रुवपदाप्रमाणे देव आपल्या अंतरी (हृदयात) नांदतो.\",\"topic\":\"कविता\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"माणूस देवाला कोठे शोधत आहे?\",\"options\":[\"स्वतःच्या मनात\",\"निर्झरीमध्ये\",\"राउळी मंदिरी\",\"जीवनामध्ये\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"माणूस देवाला देऊळ आणि मंदिरात शोधत आहे असे पहिल्या ओळीत म्हटले आहे.\",\"topic\":\"कविता\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"मेघ कोठे दाटतात?\",\"options\":[\"भूवरी\",\"अंबरी\",\"मंदिरी\",\"अंतरी\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"\'मेघ हा दाटतो कोंदणी अंबरी\' या ओळीनुसार मेघ आकाशात (अंबरी) दाटतात.\",\"topic\":\"कविता\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"\'अंबरी\' या शब्दाचा अर्थ काय?\",\"options\":[\"जमीन\",\"पाणी\",\"आकाश\",\"घर\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"कवितेत \'अंबरी\' हा शब्द आकाशासाठी वापरला आहे.\",\"topic\":\"कविता\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"पाकळी सारून कोण हासतो?\",\