se to measure the length of a pencil?\",\"options\":[\"centimetres\",\"metres\",\"kilograms\",\"litres\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"Small objects like pencils are measured in centimetres as per the textbook activity.\",\"topic\":\"Do the Activity\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which unit is suitable for measuring the distance between two houses?\",\"options\":[\"centimetres\",\"grams\",\"metres\",\"millilitres\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Longer distances between buildings are measured in metres.\",\"topic\":\"Do the Activity\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"To measure the distance from home to school, we should use:\",\"options\":[\"centimetres\",\"metres\",\"kilograms\",\"grams\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The distance from home to school is a long distance, so it is measured in metres.\",\"topic\":\"Do the Activity\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What unit is used to measure the width of a road?\",\"options\":[\"centimetres\",\"metres\",\"litres\",\"grams\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"A road is wide enough to be measured in metres rather than centimetres.\",\"topic\":\"Do the Activity\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"According to the activity, what tool should you use to measure how far a ring was thrown in an open space?\",\"options\":[\"a ruler\",\"a metre tape\",\"a weighing scale\",\"a clock\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The activity specifically mentions using a metre tape to measure the distance a ring is thrown.\",\"topic\":\"Do the Activity\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which tool is suggested to measure the distance between the classroom door and the board?\",\"options\":[\"a metre scale\",\"a pencil\",\"a handspan\",\"a string\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The textbook activity instructs to use a metre scale for measuring the distance between the door and the board.\",\"topic\":\"Do the Activity\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these would be measured in centim