understand without needing long descriptions.\",\"Maps help us find places, plan routes, and understand layouts of gardens, fairs, or cities.\"]','[{\"q\":\"According to the text, what is placed in the upper most compartment on the left side of the ship?\",\"options\":[\"A clock\",\"A vase\",\"A car\",\"A book\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text states that in the upper most compartment, on the left side of the ship, there is a clock.\",\"topic\":\"Position and Location\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In which compartment of the cupboard is the aeroplane located?\",\"options\":[\"Upper most compartment\",\"Middle compartment\",\"Lower most compartment\",\"Outside the cupboard\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text mentions the aeroplane while describing the middle compartment of the cupboard.\",\"topic\":\"Position and Location\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which object is placed in the middle compartment between the aeroplane and the car?\",\"options\":[\"A ship\",\"A ball\",\"A bullock cart\",\"A clock\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The image shows a bullock cart positioned between the aeroplane and the car in the middle shelf.\",\"topic\":\"Position and Location\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"apply\",\"figure_image\":\"13\\/071_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what is the position of the aeroplane relative to the book?\",\"options\":[\"Below the book\",\"To the right of the book\",\"Exactly above the book\",\"To the left of the book\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Looking at the cupboard, the aeroplane is on the shelf directly above the shelf containing the book.\",\"topic\":\"Position and Location\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"analyze\",\"figure_image\":\"13\\/071_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the cupboard arrangement, what is placed exactly above the car?\",\"options\":[\"The ship\",\"The vase\",\"The clock\",\"The bat\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In the cupboard, the vase is in the top compartment directly abov