opic\":\"Let\'s discuss\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which task involves assisting a family member with their school work?\",\"options\":[\"Helping younger brother\\/ sister with homework\",\"Helping in the kitchen\",\"Putting things back in place\",\"Cleaning the floor\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"Homework is a school-related task mentioned in the list.\",\"topic\":\"Let\'s discuss\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these tasks is specifically related to maintaining cleanliness in the kitchen?\",\"options\":[\"Watering the plants\",\"Washing dishes\",\"Feeding the pet\",\"Folding clothes\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Dishes are cleaned in the kitchen, making it a kitchen-related cleaning task.\",\"topic\":\"Let\'s discuss\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the list, which activity helps in saving electricity?\",\"options\":[\"Watering the plants\",\"Switching off lights before sleeping\",\"Cleaning the floor\",\"Washing dishes\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Turning off lights when not needed is a direct way to save energy.\",\"topic\":\"Let\'s discuss\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"What is the first thing learners are asked to do regarding the story characters?\",\"options\":[\"Make a list of characters\",\"Write a summary\",\"Find the meanings of names\",\"Count the number of pages\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly states to \'Make a list of characters in the story\'.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which character should a learner draw a picture of?\",\"options\":[\"The first character mentioned\",\"The character they liked the most\",\"The largest character\",\"The character that speaks the least\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text instructs to \'draw a picture of the character that you liked the most\'.\",\"topic\":\"For the Teacher\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What type of stories are teachers encouraged to have l