akes.\",\"topic\":\"The Hen\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Who told Raju that the hen is a very useful bird?\",\"options\":[\"Baba\",\"The Bullock\",\"The Farmer\",\"The Horse\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The dialogue shows the farmer explaining the usefulness of the hen to Raju.\",\"topic\":\"The Hen\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How did Baba respond when Raju asked to buy some hens?\",\"options\":[\"He was angry\",\"He ignored Raju\",\"He smiled and agreed\",\"He said they were too expensive\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text says \'Baba smiled and said, \\\"Yes, we must buy few hens.\\\"\'\",\"topic\":\"The Hen\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these animals was already at the farm before they went to the fair?\",\"options\":[\"Twenty hens\",\"Five cows\",\"A bullock\",\"Cocks\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text lists the horse, bullock, and dogs as animals they already have at the farm.\",\"topic\":\"The Hen\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the text, how many dogs do they have at their farm?\",\"options\":[\"One\",\"Two\",\"Five\",\"Twenty\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states that at the farm they have \'two dogs\'.\",\"topic\":\"The Hen\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which animal mentioned in the story is classified as a bird?\",\"options\":[\"Bullock\",\"Dog\",\"Hen\",\"Horse\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The farmer specifically refers to the hen as a \'useful bird\'.\",\"topic\":\"The Hen\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"What is the name of the place built for the horse to live in?\",\"options\":[\"Shed\",\"Coop\",\"Stable\",\"Kennel\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states that they built a stable for the horse.\",\"topic\":\"Animal Homes\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Who should be called when the animals on the farm fall ill?\",\"options\":[\"A farmer\",\"A veterinary doctor\",\"A shopkeeper\",\"A neighbor\"],\"answer\":1,\"e