es of animals share the same kind of home (a shed)?\",\"options\":[\"Hens and Dogs\",\"Horse and Bullock\",\"Cows and Bullock\",\"Dogs and Cows\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text says they built a shed for five cows and a bullock.\",\"topic\":\"Animal Homes\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What was Raju\'s role in managing the animal homes?\",\"options\":[\"He only watched the animals\",\"He helped Baba build the homes\",\"He called the doctor\",\"He lived in the stable\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text says \'Raju helped Baba to build homes for the animals.\'\",\"topic\":\"Animal Homes\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Why was Raju \'happier\' at the end of the passage?\",\"options\":[\"Because he finished his work\",\"Because the animals were happy in their new homes\",\"Because he got a new dog\",\"Because he was tired\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text links the animals being happy with Raju being even happier.\",\"topic\":\"Animal Homes\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"Which sound from the list is made by a dog?\",\"options\":[\"croaks\",\"barks\",\"bleats\",\"hisses\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"According to the textbook exercise, a dog is matched with the sound \'barks\'.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which sound does a snake make according to the exercise?\",\"options\":[\"brays\",\"bleats\",\"hisses\",\"croaks\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"In the exercise, the sound \'hisses\' is associated with a snake.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which sound is associated with a donkey in this topic?\",\"options\":[\"brays\",\"barks\",\"croaks\",\"bleats\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The sound \'brays\' is the specific sound made by a donkey as per the textbook list.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"If you see a frog, which sound from the list should you join it with?\",\"options\":[\"hisses\",\"barks\",\"b