se sounds.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21541,19,4,'English','en','Mindset','[\"- A mindset is a way of thinking that helps you do your best.\",\"- Saying \\\"I will try my best\\\" means you will keep working even if it is hard.\",\"- Learning from mistakes means you look at what went wrong and try to do better next time.\",\"- Giving up is not good; you should keep trying until you succeed.\",\"- Being positive means you think good thoughts and feel hopeful.\",\"- Practice makes things easier; the more you try, the better you get.\",\"- Trying different ways helps you find the best way to solve a problem.\",\"- Sharing thoughts with friends can give you new ideas.\",\"- Determination means you are firm in doing something.\",\"- Training your brain by learning new things keeps it strong.\"]','[{\"q\":\"According to the text, what should you do when you make mistakes?\",\"options\":[\"Give up immediately\",\"Learn from them\",\"Hide them from friends\",\"Stop practicing\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states, \'I will learn from mistakes.\'\",\"topic\":\"Complete the following\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Complete the sentence: \'I can _____ this puzzle.\'\",\"options\":[\"break\",\"solve\",\"lose\",\"hide\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"In the context of a puzzle and a positive mindset, \'solve\' is the most appropriate action.\",\"topic\":\"Complete the following\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"What happens to a task when you practice it more?\",\"options\":[\"It gets harder\",\"It stays the same\",\"It gets easier\",\"It becomes boring\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text says, \'With more practice it will get easier.\'\",\"topic\":\"Complete the following\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Complete the phrase: \'I will not give ____.\'\",\"options\":[\"in\",\"out\",\"up\",\"away\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text repeatedly 