:\"B-I-N-G-O\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the second verse, which letter is replaced by a clap?\",\"options\":[\"B\",\"I\",\"N\",\"O\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text shows \'(Clap) -I-N-G-O\', meaning \'B\' is the first letter replaced.\",\"topic\":\"B-I-N-G-O\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"If two letters are replaced by claps, how will the sequence look?\",\"options\":[\"(Clap)-I-N-G-O\",\"(Clap)-(Clap)-N-G-O\",\"B-I-(Clap)-(Clap)-O\",\"B-I-N-G-(Clap)\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text provides the sequence \'(Clap)-(Clap)-N-G-O\' for two letters missing.\",\"topic\":\"B-I-N-G-O\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"How many claps will be there in the very last verse of the song?\",\"options\":[\"3\",\"4\",\"5\",\"6\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Since there are 5 letters in B-I-N-G-O, the final verse replaces all 5 with claps.\",\"topic\":\"B-I-N-G-O\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which of these is NOT one of the instructions given at the start of the topic?\",\"options\":[\"Listen\",\"Learn\",\"Sing\",\"Write\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"The instructions are \'Listen, learn, sing and play\'; \'Write\' is not mentioned.\",\"topic\":\"B-I-N-G-O\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which letter is the last one to be replaced by a clap in the song sequence?\",\"options\":[\"B\",\"I\",\"G\",\"O\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"The sequence shows letters being replaced one by one from left to right, making \'O\' the last.\",\"topic\":\"B-I-N-G-O\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What happens to the number of claps as the song progresses through the verses?\",\"options\":[\"They decrease\",\"They stay the same\",\"They increase\",\"They disappear\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The song starts with no claps and adds one more clap in each verse until all letters are replaced.\",\"topic\":\"B-I-N-G-O\",\"part\":6,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What is the complete sentence used in the \'Vani