s for Teachers\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"}]','gemini/gemini-3-flash-preview','2026-10-03 16:25:28'),(21655,27,5,'English','en','How Creatures Move','[\"Creatures move in different ways to survive and find food.\",\"Some animals walk, run, or crawl on land.\",\"Birds fly using their wings.\",\"Fish swim in water using their fins and tail.\",\"Insects like ants and bees have six legs and can walk or fly.\",\"Snakes move by slithering in a wave-like motion.\",\"Frogs jump using their strong hind legs.\",\"Movement helps animals escape danger and find shelter.\",\"Different body parts like legs, wings, fins, and tails help in movement.\",\"The way an animal moves depends on its habitat and body structure.\"]','[{\"q\":\"According to the poem, how does the lion walk?\",\"options\":[\"On sharp claws\",\"On padded paws\",\"On heavy feet\",\"On long legs\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The poem states \'The lion walks on padded paws\'.\",\"topic\":\"कविता\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Where do flies crawl straight up, according to the text?\",\"options\":[\"A tree\",\"A limb\",\"A wall\",\"The ground\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The poem mentions \'flies can crawl straight up a wall\'.\",\"topic\":\"कविता\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which creature is described as wiggling all around?\",\"options\":[\"The monkey\",\"The seal\",\"The worm\",\"The fly\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text says \'The worm he wiggles all around\'.\",\"topic\":\"कविता\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What does the squirrel leap from, according to the poem?\",\"options\":[\"Wall to wall\",\"Ground to ground\",\"Limb to limb\",\"Tail to tail\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The poem states \'The squirrel leaps from limb to limb\'.\",\"topic\":\"कविता\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what is the monkey using to hang from the tree branch?\",\"options\":[\"His hands\",\"His feet\",\"His tail\",\"His head\"],\"answ