n that teachers should have students stand in different places to practice telling others where they are.\",\"topic\":\"स्थान खेळ\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If you are following the instruction to play the game \'outside the classroom\', which location would be most appropriate to use?\",\"options\":[\"Near the blackboard\",\"On the last bench\",\"Under the tree in the garden\",\"Second line, second bench\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Benches and blackboards are inside the classroom; a tree in the garden is a location outside.\",\"topic\":\"स्थान खेळ\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which phrase from the text describes a specific grid-like position in the classroom?\",\"options\":[\"Near the window\",\"Second line, second bench\",\"At the back\",\"Right in front of you\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"\'Second line, second bench\' uses a coordinate-like system to identify a specific spot.\",\"topic\":\"स्थान खेळ\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What final encouragement does the text give to students participating in these location games?\",\"options\":[\"Do not run in the class\",\"Do not be afraid to speak\",\"Listen to the teacher only\",\"Stay in your seat\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The very last line of the text is \'Do not be afraid to speak.\'\",\"topic\":\"स्थान खेळ\",\"part\":8,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What is the price of the ticket for the Dance Festival?\",\"options\":[\"₹ 50\",\"₹ 100\",\"₹ 150\",\"₹ 200\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The ticket clearly states the price as ₹ 150.\",\"topic\":\"इंग्रजी मजकुरांचे कोलाज\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Where is the \'Vastra Emporium\' located?\",\"options\":[\"Nagpur\",\"Amravati\",\"Talegaon\",\"Mumbai\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The advertisement for Vastra Emporium lists the address as 101, South Main Road, Amravati.\",\"topic\":\"इंग्रजी मजकुरांचे कोलाज\",\"part\":9,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"According to the ticket, what happens if y