ntioned in the text for making the model?\",\"options\":[\"Plastic\",\"Metal\",\"Clay\",\"Wood\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text lists clay as one of the materials to be used for the model.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Where should the finished model be shown according to the instructions?\",\"options\":[\"In the school garden\",\"At the student\'s home\",\"In the principal\'s office\",\"In your class\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"The text states that the model should be displayed \'in your class\'.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What is the main task described in the exercise?\",\"options\":[\"Writing an essay about ice\",\"Drawing a picture of an Eskimo\",\"Preparing a physical model\",\"Reading a story aloud\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The instruction starts with \'Prepare a model\', which involves physical construction.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which material is NOT listed in the text for creating the Igloo?\",\"options\":[\"Cotton\",\"Mold\",\"Sand\",\"Clay\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text mentions mold, clay, and cotton, but does not mention sand.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"What does the word \'display\' mean in the context of this activity?\",\"options\":[\"To hide the model\",\"To show the model to others\",\"To break the model\",\"To sell the model\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Displaying in class means showing the work to the teacher and classmates.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If a student wants to use a soft, white material from the list to represent snow, which should they choose?\",\"options\":[\"Mold\",\"Clay\",\"Cotton\",\"Class\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Cotton is the material from the list that best represents the appearance of snow.\",\"topic\":\"Exercise\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"A student has finished