"On which axis are the columns for each occupation drawn in a standard bar graph as described?\",\"options\":[\"Y axis\",\"X axis\",\"Both X and Y axes\",\"The scale axis\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Step 5 states to draw columns for each occupation on the X axis.\",\"topic\":\"Illustrative Examples\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Using the scale 1cm = 5 persons, what would be the height of the column for the \'Service\' occupation which has 35 people?\",\"options\":[\"5 cm\",\"6 cm\",\"7 cm\",\"8 cm\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"If 1cm represents 5 people, then 35 people \\/ 5 = 7 cm.\",\"topic\":\"Illustrative Examples\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which occupation has the lowest number of people engaged in it?\",\"options\":[\"Farmer\",\"Merchant\",\"Service\",\"Daily Wage Worker\"],\"answer\":3,\"explain\":\"The figure shows the \'Daily Wage Worker\' column is the shortest, representing 15 people.\",\"topic\":\"Illustrative Examples\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"apply\",\"figure_image\":\"34\\/154_102.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the table provided, how many more people are Farmers than Merchants in Motinagar colony?\",\"options\":[\"5\",\"10\",\"15\",\"20\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Farmers (40) minus Merchants (25) equals 15.\",\"topic\":\"Illustrative Examples\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"According to the \'Mathematical Discussion\', what is a key factor to consider when determining the scale of a graph?\",\"options\":[\"The size of the graph paper\",\"The color of the columns\",\"The number of questions prepared\",\"The names of the businesses\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The discussion points ask if the graph is drawn to scale according to the size of the graph paper.\",\"topic\":\"Illustrative Examples\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What is the total number of people living in Motinagar colony whose occupations are listed in the table?\",\"options\":[\"100\",\"115\",\"120\",\"90\"],\"