d\"},{\"q\":\"By how many times could the instrument invented by Bose magnify the growth of a plant?\",\"options\":[\"One hundred times\",\"One thousand times\",\"Ten thousand times\",\"One lakh times\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text specifies the instrument could magnify the movements and growth ten thousand times.\",\"topic\":\"Do You Know? (Jagadish Chandra Bose)\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which of the following sensations can plants perceive, as proven by the scientist in the text?\",\"options\":[\"Heat, cold, or pain\",\"Taste and smell\",\"Sound and speech\",\"Colors and shapes\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text mentions that Bose proved plants perceive sensations like heat, cold, or pain.\",\"topic\":\"Do You Know? (Jagadish Chandra Bose)\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If a researcher wants to record a very tiny movement of a plant that is too small to see, which invention mentioned in the text would be most helpful?\",\"options\":[\"A simple magnifying glass\",\"A thermometer\",\"Bose\'s magnifying and recording instrument\",\"A moisture meter\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text describes an instrument invented by Bose that could magnify and record plant movements 10,000 times.\",\"topic\":\"Do You Know? (Jagadish Chandra Bose)\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the text, if a plant is touched with a very cold object, what would Sir Jagadish Chandra Bose\'s discovery suggest?\",\"options\":[\"The plant will not be affected at all\",\"The plant has a system to perceive this sensation\",\"The plant will grow faster towards the cold\",\"The plant only reacts to moisture, not cold\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"Bose proved plants have a special system to perceive sensations like cold.\",\"topic\":\"Do You Know? (Jagadish Chandra Bose)\",\"part\":7,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, the person depicted is significant in science because he was the first to prove that ________.\",\"o