or cooking?\",\"options\":[\"To save water for the farmers\",\"To make the recipes easier to follow\",\"To preserve the nutritive values of the food\",\"To make the food reach the plate faster\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"Using only the required amount of water (and not excess) is part of preserving the nutritive values mentioned in the text.\",\"topic\":\"Balanced Diet and Cooking Skills\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Identify the correct sequence of food reaching the consumer.\",\"options\":[\"Kitchen -> Farm -> Plate\",\"Farm -> Kitchen -> Plate\",\"Plate -> Kitchen -> Farm\",\"Seller -> Farm -> Kitchen\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text describes the journey as reaching consumers from the farm, being transformed in the kitchen, and finally reaching the plate.\",\"topic\":\"Balanced Diet and Cooking Skills\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which of the following people are NOT mentioned in the text as being behind the effort of bringing food to our plate?\",\"options\":[\"Farmers\",\"Sellers\",\"Doctors\",\"Cooks\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text mentions farmers, workers, sellers, and cooks, but does not mention doctors.\",\"topic\":\"Balanced Diet and Cooking Skills\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the text, why is it important to respect and value food?\",\"options\":[\"Because food is very expensive to buy\",\"Because many people put in effort to bring it to us\",\"Because it is transformed into tasty meals\",\"Because it contains carbohydrates and fats\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states we should respect food because of the efforts of many people like farmers, workers, sellers, and cooks.\",\"topic\":\"Balanced Diet and Cooking Skills\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"If a student wants to help their mother preserve nutrition while cooking, which action should they suggest?\",\"options\":[\"Peel the potatoes before putting them in the pot\",\"Wash the spinach after it has been c