nerated by solar panels.\",\"topic\":\"Sunlight and Wind Energy\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Why is solar energy considered a very important source of energy?\",\"options\":[\"It is only available in India\",\"It is environment-friendly, free and inexhaustible\",\"It is used only for drying clothes\",\"It is very rare and hard to find\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text highlights that solar energy is important because it is environment-friendly, free, and inexhaustible.\",\"topic\":\"Sunlight and Wind Energy\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Where is the large wind energy project located in Maharashtra?\",\"options\":[\"Mumbai\",\"Pune\",\"Chalkewadi in Satara district\",\"Nagpur\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text specifies that there is a large wind energy project at \'Chalkewadi\' in Satara district.\",\"topic\":\"Sunlight and Wind Energy\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What causes the windmills to rotate to generate electricity?\",\"options\":[\"Solar energy\",\"Vitamin D\",\"Wind\",\"Heat from the sun\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states that due to wind, the windmills rotate, which allows electricity to be generated.\",\"topic\":\"Sunlight and Wind Energy\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If a household wants to get hot water using solar energy, which device should they use?\",\"options\":[\"Solar cooker\",\"Solar heater\",\"Windmill\",\"Salt pan\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text mentions the use of devices like solar heaters to get hot water.\",\"topic\":\"Sunlight and Wind Energy\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"What is a \'Wind energy project\'?\",\"options\":[\"A place where salt is made using wind\",\"A project that produces large amount of electricity using many windmills\",\"A project to study the envelope of air\",\"A project to grow crops using wind\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text defines \'Wind energy projects\' as projects that produce large amounts of electri