uick!\'.\",\"topic\":\"Game: Be quick!\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What is the time limit set for reading all the words in one table in the \'Be quick!\' game?\",\"options\":[\"10 seconds\",\"15 seconds\",\"20 seconds\",\"30 seconds\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The instructions ask \'Who can read all the words in one table within 15 seconds?\'.\",\"topic\":\"Game: Be quick!\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In \'Game One-Two-Three!\', what must partners do after exchanging the words they have written?\",\"options\":[\"Read the words as fast as possible\",\"Write meaningful phrases using those words\",\"Count the number of letters in each word\",\"Say the alphabet from A to Z again\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text says, \'Exchange the words you write. Then use the words you get to write meaningful phrases.\'\",\"topic\":\"Game: Be quick!\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In the game \'Be quick!\', what should a student do if they cannot read the table in 15 seconds yet?\",\"options\":[\"Choose a different game\",\"Skip the difficult words\",\"Practise reading aloud correctly\",\"Write the words down instead\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text advises to \'Practise reading these words aloud correctly till you can do so in 15 seconds.\'\",\"topic\":\"Game: Be quick!\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"In \'Game One-Two-Three!\', how does the first person say the alphabet?\",\"options\":[\"Aloud for everyone to hear\",\"In his mind\",\"By writing it on paper\",\"Backwards from Z to A\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The instructions state, \'One person says the alphabet from A to Z in his mind\'.\",\"topic\":\"Game: Be quick!\",\"part\":3,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"If you are playing \'Game One-Two-Three!\' and your partner stops you at the letter \'S\', how many words must you write beginning with \'S\'?\",\"options\":[\"One word\",\"Two words\",\"Three words\",\"Five words\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\"