 says he loves to have fun and his superpowers help him do just that.\",\"topic\":\"The Brave Trickster\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If Sun Wukong wanted to hide inside a small teapot, which superpower would he use?\",\"options\":[\"His speed\",\"His ability to grow very tiny\",\"His intelligence\",\"His ability to open locks\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text mentions he can grow very tiny at a blink, which would allow him to fit in small spaces.\",\"topic\":\"The Brave Trickster\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"If an enemy is trying to escape, which physical quality of Sun Wukong makes it hard for them to get away?\",\"options\":[\"He is very very quick\",\"He is very old\",\"He has a vase\",\"He is brave\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text describes him as being very very quick.\",\"topic\":\"The Brave Trickster\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"How quickly can Sun Wukong change his size?\",\"options\":[\"In a few hours\",\"After a long sleep\",\"At a blink\",\"In one minute\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states he can grow very big and very tiny at a blink.\",\"topic\":\"The Brave Trickster\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the text, what is the primary purpose of Sun Wukong\'s \'tricks\'?\",\"options\":[\"To destroy the world\",\"To tease his enemies\",\"To earn money\",\"To clean his house\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text says you can imagine how he must have teased his enemies using these tricks.\",\"topic\":\"The Brave Trickster\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which word from the text best describes Sun Wukong\'s playful and mischievous nature?\",\"options\":[\"Intelligent\",\"Brave\",\"Trickster\",\"Quick\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"A trickster is someone who plays tricks and is mischievous, which matches his description of loving fun.\",\"topic\":\"The Brave Trickster\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which statement best summarizes Sun Wukong\'s abilities as described in the passage?\",\"options\":[\"He is only strong and fights with weapons.\",\"He is a serious warrior with no sense of humor.\",\"He uses magical objects and physical transformations to tease others.\",\"He is a slow character who relies only on his vase.\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text details his vase, lock-opening, speed, and size-changing as ways he teases enemies.\",\"topic\":\"The Brave Trickster\",\"part\":10,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"Where can you find the stories of the adventures of Sun Wukong and his companions?\",\"options\":[\"In a Marathi translation of \'Journey to the West\'\",\"In the English translation of \'Journey to the West\'\",\"In a history textbook of China\",\"In a science journal\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states that stories of the adventures can be found in the English translation of \'Journey to the West\'.\",\"topic\":\"Journey to the West Stories\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"According to the text, what has happened to some of the stories from \'Journey to the West\'?\",\"options\":[\"They have been banned\",\"They have been turned into films\",\"They have been lost forever\",\"They have been turned into poems\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text mentions that some of the stories have also been turned into films.\",\"topic\":\"Journey to the West Stories\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"What type of account is associated with Yuan Chwang\'s travels in the text?\",\"options\":[\"A fantastic story\",\"A fictional drama\",\"A historical account\",\"A scientific report\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text refers to the \'historical account of Yuan Chwang\'s travels\'.\",\"topic\":\"Journey to the West Stories\",\"part\":11,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How does the text describe the stories of Sun Wukong?\",\"options\":[\"Boring and long\",\"Historical and factual\",\"Fantastic stories\",\"Difficult to translate\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The t