Architect designs -> Engineer finalizes -> Mason builds\",\"Contractor sends for mason -> Architect designs -> Mason builds\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text describes the order as design by architect, finalization by engineer, then building by the mason.\",\"topic\":\"The Dedicated Mason\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"What does the phrase \'to no avail\' mean according to the given figure?\",\"options\":[\"Of no use\",\"Very helpful\",\"Continuous efforts\",\"Unwillingness\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The glossary in the figure defines \'to no avail\' as \'of no use\'.\",\"topic\":\"The Dedicated Mason\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\",\"figure_image\":\"52\\/041_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"According to the text, what does the word \'zeal\' mean?\",\"options\":[\"Constant careful efforts\",\"Great enthusiasm and energy in one\'s efforts\",\"Money given for work done\",\"Continuous efforts\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly defines zeal as great enthusiasm and energy in one\'s efforts.\",\"topic\":\"Decision to Retire\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which word in the text means \'money given for work done\'?\",\"options\":[\"Persistence\",\"Diligence\",\"Recompensed\",\"Scarcity\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The glossary in the text defines \'recompensed\' as money given for work done.\",\"topic\":\"Decision to Retire\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"At what point in his life did the mason decide it was time to retire?\",\"options\":[\"When he became a father\",\"When he became a grandfather\",\"When the contractor stopped paying him\",\"When he lost his zeal for work\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text states he worked for many years until he became a grandfather, then decided to retire.\",\"topic\":\"Decision to Retire\",\"part\":5,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How did the contractor feel when the mason informed him of his decision to retire?\",\"options\":[\"He was happy for the mason\",\"He was angr