ife?\",\"options\":[\"In a busy city\",\"In a small village\",\"In lonely lighthouses\",\"In a school dormitory\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text mentions she had lived all her life in lonely lighthouses.\",\"topic\":\"Grace Darling\'s Early Life\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Which of the following describes the location of Grace\'s home?\",\"options\":[\"Near a crowded marketplace\",\"In the heart of a town\",\"Far away from towns and cities\",\"Next to a large village\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states her home was far away from towns and cities, with not even a village nearby.\",\"topic\":\"Grace Darling\'s Early Life\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Who was responsible for the education of Grace and her siblings?\",\"options\":[\"A private tutor from the city\",\"Their father\",\"Their mother\",\"A teacher from the nearest village\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text says their father was a wise man who taught them to read and write.\",\"topic\":\"Grace Darling\'s Early Life\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"How does the text describe Grace\'s father as a person?\",\"options\":[\"Wealthy and powerful\",\"Strict and angry\",\"Wise and educated\",\"Quiet and lonely\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text describes Grace’s father as a wise and educated man.\",\"topic\":\"Grace Darling\'s Early Life\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the text, what was the social environment of Grace\'s childhood?\",\"options\":[\"Socially active with many neighbors\",\"Isolated and lonely\",\"Competitive and urban\",\"Culturally diverse\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text mentions she lived in lonely lighthouses with the nearest neighbors many miles away.\",\"topic\":\"Grace Darling\'s Early Life\",\"part\":2,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"Which values did Grace\'s father instill in his children?\",\"options\":[\"Honesty, bravery, and unselfishness\",\"Ambition, wealth, and power\",\"Cunning, speed,