hel Ratna (2016).\"]','[{\"q\":\"According to the matching list in the text, where is the game of Cricket played?\",\"options\":[\"Court\",\"Ground\",\"Arena\",\"Course\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text matches (1) cricket with (a) ground.\",\"topic\":\"WARMING UP !\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the given table, which place is specifically associated with the game of Golf?\",\"options\":[\"Rink\",\"Board\",\"Course\",\"Court\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text matches (3) golf with (d) course.\",\"topic\":\"WARMING UP !\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the matching exercise, a \'Rink\' is the place where which sport is played?\",\"options\":[\"Skating\",\"Boxing\",\"Cricket\",\"Carrom\"],\"answer\":0,\"explain\":\"The text matches (5) skating with (c) rink.\",\"topic\":\"WARMING UP !\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"Which game is played on a \'Board\' according to the provided text?\",\"options\":[\"Golf\",\"Badminton\",\"Carrom\",\"Skating\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text matches (6) carrom with (b) board.\",\"topic\":\"WARMING UP !\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"understand\"},{\"q\":\"If an athlete is heading to a \'Court\', which game from the list are they most likely going to play?\",\"options\":[\"Cricket\",\"Badminton\",\"Boxing\",\"Golf\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text matches (2) badminton with (e) court.\",\"topic\":\"WARMING UP !\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"apply\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which equipment consists of three vertical wooden posts used for the game of Cricket?\",\"options\":[\"The racket\",\"The hockey stick\",\"The stumps\",\"The javelin\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The image shows cricket stumps (three vertical posts) on the left side.\",\"topic\":\"WARMING UP !\",\"part\":1,\"bloom\":\"remember\",\"figure_image\":\"52\\/090_101.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, which object is used along with the racket to play the game of Badminton?\",\"options\":[\"The tennis b