s to avoid sitting in discomfort for long.\",\"topic\":\"Precautions and Safety Measures\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"analyze\"},{\"q\":\"Which of the following actions is considered unsafe according to the precautions mentioned?\",\"options\":[\"Using a battery-operated torch\",\"Using a staircase to go down\",\"Using a lift in a multistoried building\",\"Folding hands around the head\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text explicitly says to avoid using the lift in multistoried buildings.\",\"topic\":\"Precautions and Safety Measures\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"evaluate\"},{\"q\":\"According to the text, how long should you stay under a piece of furniture?\",\"options\":[\"For exactly five minutes\",\"Until the movement of earth stops\",\"Until you hear a loud noise\",\"Until the lights come back on\"],\"answer\":1,\"explain\":\"The text says to cover yourself until the movement of earth stops.\",\"topic\":\"Precautions and Safety Measures\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"remember\"},{\"q\":\"In the given figure, what safety measure is the person demonstrating while at home?\",\"options\":[\"Cleaning the area under the table\",\"Looking for a safe exit\",\"Taking shelter below furniture to cover themselves\",\"Checking the strength of the table legs\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The figure shows a person sitting under a table to protect themselves during an earthquake.\",\"topic\":\"Precautions and Safety Measures\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"understand\",\"figure_image\":\"57\\/073_102.jpg\"},{\"q\":\"Based on the given figure, if the table was not present, what should the person do with their hands according to the text?\",\"options\":[\"Wave them for help\",\"Hold onto the wall\",\"Fold them around the head\",\"Keep them flat on the floor\"],\"answer\":2,\"explain\":\"The text states that if there is no shelter, sit in a corner and cover the head by folding hands around it.\",\"topic\":\"Precautions and Safety Measures\",\"part\":4,\"bloom\":\"apply\",\"figure_image\":\"57\\/073_1